    <node id="&quot;算法问题&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"算法问题 (algorithmic problem) refers to the computational challenge of counting the number of length-k contiguous subarrays that are '好数组', based on specific palindrome-related conditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7ca5047ad2314016a91534ae51d7d7e9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;修改一个元素&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"修改一个元素 (modify exactly one element) is the critical operation required to transform a non-palindromic array into a palindromic one, forming the second defining condition of a '好数组'."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7ca5047ad2314016a91534ae51d7d7e9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIGNED MAIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"signed main is the C++ function signature used in the student program, indicating the main function returns a signed integer, typical in competitive programming code for compatibility with online judges."&lt;SEP&gt;"signed main 是学生程序的主函数入口，负责循环处理多个测试用例并调用 solve 函数。"</data>
