    <node id="&quot;-1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"-1 is a constant integer element used in the student's matrix, contributing to the determinant calculation and satisfying the absolute value constraint of ≥1."&lt;SEP&gt;"The integer -1 is a fixed matrix element in the student's solution, acting as a negative-valued 'location' in the matrix that influences the determinant's sign and magnitude, and contributes to the failure in edge cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"-1 是学生程序在无法构造合法排列时的输出标志，表示该排列构造事件失败，是算法输出的错误状态标识。"</data>
