      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"2 is a constant integer element used in the student's matrix, chosen to help control the determinant's value, though not dynamically adjusted for all x."&lt;SEP&gt;"The integer 2 is a fixed matrix element in the student's solution, serving as a constant positive value in the matrix that affects the determinant's baseline computation and is part of the flawed construction logic."</data>
