      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"e is the dynamically computed element in the bottom-right of the matrix, intended to adjust the determinant to equal x, but contains flawed logic for edge cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"e is the dynamically computed matrix element in the student program, intended to adjust the determinant to equal x. Its flawed calculation logic is the core source of the program's error, making it a critical 'location' of failure in the solution space."</data>
