    <node id="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"硝基甲苯之袭 是本题的标题或命名事件，代表小苯所面临的算法挑战问题，涉及异或与最大公约数的数学关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"硝基甲苯之袭是本题的标题，指代小苯所面临的算法问题情境，即在数组中寻找满足异或等于最大公约数的元素对的计数问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"硝基甲苯之袭是本题的标题，指代小苯所面对的算法问题场景，即在数组中寻找满足异或等于最大公约数的元素对的计数问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"硝基甲苯之袭是本题的标题，象征性地指代该算法问题的挑战性场景，涉及异或与最大公约数的数学关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"硝基甲苯之袭是本题的标题，象征性地指代小苯所面临的数学与编程挑战，即寻找满足 a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j) 的元素对数量的问题。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f831b89c29a24b6f937f910e69eb76a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;A_I&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"a_i is the i-th integer in the sequence, randomly and independently generated within the interval [L[i], R[i]]."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_i represents an element in the array at index i, used in the mathematical condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j). It is a variable denoting a value from the input array."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_i represents an element in the array at index i, used in the mathematical condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j). It is a variable in the problem's formulation, not a physical entity, but treated as an abstract participant in the relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_i represents an element in the array at index i, used in the mathematical condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j). It is a variable placeholder for array elements in the problem statement."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_i 是数组中的第 i 个整数元素，作为问题中被选取和运算的基本对象，参与异或与最大公约数的计算。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a_i represents an element in the array at index i, used in the mathematical condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j); it is a variable placeholder for array elements in the problem statement."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_i is the i-th random integer in the sequence, drawn independently and uniformly from the interval [L[i], R[i]], forming the core variable of the mathematical problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_i represents the i-th element in the sequence, a randomly generated integer within the interval [l_i, r_i], central to the computation of the sequence's value."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f831b89c29a24b6f937f910e69eb76a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;A_J&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"a_j represents an element in the array at index j (where j &gt; i), used in the mathematical condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j). It is a variable denoting another value from the input array."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_j represents an element in the array at index j (where j &gt; i), used in the mathematical condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j). It is a variable in the problem's formulation, not a physical entity, but treated as an abstract participant in the relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_j represents an element in the array at index j (where j &gt; i), used in the mathematical condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j). It is a variable placeholder for array elements in the problem statement."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_j 是数组中的第 j 个整数元素（j &gt; i），与 a_i 配对进行异或和最大公约数运算，是满足条件的元素对中的第二个元素。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a_j represents an element in the array at index j (where j &gt; i), used in the mathematical condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j); it is a variable placeholder for array elements in the problem statement."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f831b89c29a24b6f937f910e69eb76a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GCD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"gcd (greatest common divisor) is a mathematical function or operation that computes the largest positive integer dividing two numbers without remainder, central to the problem's constraint."&lt;SEP&gt;"gcd (greatest common divisor) is a mathematical function referenced in the problem to define the constraint for valid pairs; it is treated as a conceptual entity governing the relationship between array elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"gcd stands for greatest common divisor, a mathematical function used to compute the largest positive integer that divides two numbers without remainder. It is central to the problem's condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"gcd 是最大公约数（Greatest Common Divisor）的数学函数符号，用于计算两个整数的公共最大约数，是问题核心约束条件的一部分。"&lt;SEP&gt;"gcd is the mathematical function representing the greatest common divisor, used to compare the largest shared divisor between two integers a_i and a_j."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f831b89c29a24b6f937f910e69eb76a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;XOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"xor (exclusive OR) is a bitwise logical operation used in the problem to compare binary representations of two integers, forming the left-hand side of the equation a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"xor (exclusive OR) is a bitwise operation referenced in the problem as the left-hand side of the constraint a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j); it is treated as a conceptual operator entity in the algorithmic condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"xor stands for bitwise exclusive OR, a binary operation used in the problem to compare bits of two integers. It is a core component of the condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"xor 是按位异或运算符的符号表示，用于对两个整数进行位级运算，是问题中与 gcd 等价的另一核心运算。"&lt;SEP&gt;"xor is the bitwise exclusive OR operation, used in the condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j) to compare bit-level differences between two integers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f831b89c29a24b6f937f910e69eb76a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;M = 2E5 + 7&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"M = 2e5 + 7 是程序中定义的数组大小常量，表示程序可处理的最大输入规模，是算法空间复杂度的地理边界设定。"&lt;SEP&gt;"M 是学生程序中定义的常量，用于设置数组或数据结构的最大大小，以处理题目中可能的最大输入规模。"&lt;SEP&gt;"M 是学生程序中定义的常量，用于设置数组或数据结构的最大规模，是程序实现的内存约束参数。"&lt;SEP&gt;"M 是代码中定义的常量，用于设置数组或数据结构的最大大小，是程序内存分配的边界参数。"&lt;SEP&gt;"M 是学生程序中定义的常量，用于设置数组大小上限，属于代码实现中的内存优化参数。"&lt;SEP&gt;"M is a constant in the student's code defining the maximum array size for input constraints, used to allocate memory for data structures like vis[] and f[]."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CNT[M]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"cnt[M] is a frequency counter array in the student’s program, used to track how many times each value appears in the input array."&lt;SEP&gt;"cnt[M] 是一个计数数组，用于记录数组中每个数值出现的频次，是优化算法效率的关键数据结构，其大小受 M 限制。"</data>
