    <node id="&quot;40.0&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"40.0 is the partial score achieved by the student program in the programming competition, indicating that the solution correctly handles some test cases but fails on others due to logical errors in median selection and element grouping."&lt;SEP&gt;"40.0 is the score achieved by the student’s program on the given test case, indicating partial correctness due to logical errors in median computation and element counting logic within the 双生数组 solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"40.0 是学生程序在评测系统中获得的分数，表明其部分正确，但存在关键逻辑缺陷未完全解决双生数组转换问题。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e091fd25a6ba2509fa168c85c52636ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7230c75a37c25448800f6f28d89050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44c8edff064a63bf1c338d7c234b2385</data>
    </node>
