      <data key="d1">"NOI (National Olympiad in Informatics) is the Chinese national programming competition context implied by the problem’s structure, language, and coding style, typical of such contests."&lt;SEP&gt;"NOI (National Olympiad in Informatics) is the Chinese national programming competition context implied by the problem’s structure, mathematical rigor, and coding style, typical of contest problems in China."</data>
