      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Record ID: 50-1 is a system log entry timestamped 2025-01-21 17:44:01, documenting the failure of the student's solution in an automated grading or evaluation system."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660</data>
