    <node id="&quot;OJ SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"OJ System (Online Judge System) is the automated platform used in Chinese educational programming contexts to evaluate student submissions, where this problem and error were logged and assessed."</data>
