    </node>
    <node id="&quot;N×N 01矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"n×n 01矩阵 is the input data structure in the problem — a square binary matrix of size n×n composed of '0' and '1' characters, which the student must transform into a '好矩阵' using adjacent swaps."&lt;SEP&gt;"n×n 01矩阵 refers to the input binary matrix of size n×n composed of '0' and '1' characters, which the student must transform into a '好矩阵' using adjacent swaps."&lt;SEP&gt;"n×n 01矩阵 refers to the input matrix of size n×n composed only of '0' and '1' characters, which the student program must transform into a '好矩阵' through adjacent swaps. It is the central data structure in the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"n×n 01矩阵是题目输入的初始数据结构，由n行n列的'0'和'1'字符构成，目标是通过相邻交换操作将其转化为好矩阵，是问题操作的直接对象。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4c02916b7b0e5a87f92d544844a99ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c5bdeaa2e5f505a00838eed99bce2dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;操作次数上限 N³/2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"操作次数上限 n³/2 是题目对解法效率的约束条件，保证存在合法解，是评估算法正确性与效率的关键标准。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-63d7c8c700f1653b2de9c2e270fef6e6</data>
    </node>
