    <node id="&quot;RECORD ID: 60-1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Record ID: 60-1 is a metadata identifier for a specific submission record, timestamped 2025-01-21 17:56:34, used to track the evaluation of the student’s program in an automated grading system."</data>
