      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"字符串 t is the target string of length n composed of lowercase letters, whose existence and properties are being evaluated based on the defined可爱度 criterion."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串 t is the target string of length n composed of lowercase letters, whose existence and properties are being queried in relation to the defined可爱度 metric."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STD::CIN.TIE(NULLPTR),STD::COUT.TIE(NULLPTR)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"std::cin.tie(nullptr),std::cout.tie(nullptr) are C++ stream untie commands used in the student program to improve I/O performance by disabling synchronization between C and C++ streams."&lt;SEP&gt;"std::cin.tie(nullptr),std::cout.tie(nullptr) are C++ stream untieing directives used in the student's program to further optimize I/O performance in competitive programming."</data>
