      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"std::cout is a C++ standard output stream object, used to display the computed result (ans) to the console, acting as the final output mechanism in the program."&lt;SEP&gt;"std::cout 是 C++ 标准库中的输出流对象，用于输出 'YES' 或 'NO' 以及构造的字符串，是程序结果的输出通道。"</data>
