    <node id="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and can unleash a special ability called 'Dragon's Breath' to defeat monsters on a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and can unleash a special ability called 'Dragon's Breath' to defeat monsters on a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and can unleash a special ability called 'Dragon's Breath' to defeat monsters on a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and uses the 'Dragon's Breath' ability to eliminate monsters on a grid map by activating diagonal flame patterns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and uses the 'Dragon's Breath' ability to eliminate monsters on a grid map by targeting specific coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and can use a special ability called 'Dragon's Breath' to eliminate monsters on a grid map by targeting a coordinate and damaging cells along diagonal lines in an 'X' shape."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person associated with a mathematical problem involving a sequence of random integers and the computation of the expected value of the absolute difference sum between consecutive elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person associated with a mathematical problem involving a sequence of random integers and the computation of the expected value of the absolute difference sum between consecutive elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person associated with a mathematical problem involving a sequence of random integers and the computation of the expected value of the absolute difference sum between consecutive elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person associated with a mathematical problem involving a sequence of random integers and the calculation of the expected value of the sum of absolute differences between consecutive elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person associated with a mathematical problem involving a sequence of random integers and the calculation of the expected value of the absolute difference sum between consecutive elements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a6cf2c1b884640bd458e20b236729e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dragon's Breath is a special ability that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters at coordinates along the two diagonals centered at a chosen point (x,y)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters on diagonal lines extending from a central coordinate (x,y)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters on diagonal paths from a chosen coordinate (x,y)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that unleashes flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters on diagonal lines from a chosen coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters along diagonal lines from a targeted coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that damages monsters along diagonal lines extending from a targeted coordinate (x,y) in four directions: (x-1,y-1), (x-1,y+1), (x+1,y-1), (x+1,y+1), forming an 'X' pattern on the grid."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A grid map with n rows and m columns, where each cell (i,j) contains a number of monsters denoted by a_{i,j}. The map is the battlefield for the Dragon's Breath ability."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a number of monsters denoted by a_{i,j}, and the Dragon's Breath ability affects cells along diagonal paths within this grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"The grid map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a number of monsters denoted by a_{i,j}, and the Dragon's Breath ability affects cells along diagonal paths."&lt;SEP&gt;"A grid map with n rows and m columns, where each cell (i,j) contains a_{i,j} monsters, used as the battlefield for the Dragon's Breath ability."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a number of monsters denoted by a_{i,j}, and the Dragon's Breath ability affects cells along diagonal paths."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a_{i,j} monsters. It is the battlefield where Dragon's Breath is deployed and where monster counts are calculated."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"a_{i,j} denotes the number of monsters located at coordinate (i,j) on the grid map, forming the data structure that Dragon's Breath interacts with."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} is the number of monsters located at coordinate (i,j) in the grid map, forming the data used to calculate the total damage of Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} is the numerical value representing the number of monsters located at coordinate (i,j) in the grid map, used to calculate the total damage of Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} represents the number of monsters located at coordinate (i,j) on the grid map, forming the quantitative data structure for the battlefield."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} is the numerical value representing the count of monsters located at coordinate (i,j) on the grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} is the number of monsters located at coordinate (i,j) on the grid map, serving as the key data input for calculating the total damage of Dragon's Breath."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;(X,Y)&quot;">
