    <node id="&quot;QUERY&quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
      <data key="d1">"query is a function in the student's program that computes the expected absolute difference between two sequence elements using inclusion-exclusion over their respective ranges [L[i], R[i]] and [L[j], R[j]]."&lt;SEP&gt;"query relies on solve to compute expected absolute differences over intervals using inclusion-exclusion principles."&lt;SEP&gt;"query is a helper function that computes the expected absolute difference between two random variables over arbitrary intervals [L[i], R[i]] and [L[j], R[j]] using inclusion-exclusion over the solve function."</data>
