    <node id="&quot;POW&quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pow is a function in the program that computes modular exponentiation, used to calculate modular inverses for division under modulo arithmetic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pow is used within solve to perform modular division, enabling correct computation under modulo arithmetic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pow is a utility function in the student's code that computes modular exponentiation, used to calculate modular inverses for probability normalization in the expectation formula."</data>
