    <node id="&quot;L_I&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"l_i is the left boundary of the i-th query's subinterval [l_i, r_i] in the permutation array."&lt;SEP&gt;"l_i is the left boundary of the subinterval in the i-th query, used to define the range of elements to be sorted."&lt;SEP&gt;"l_i is the lower bound of the interval from which the i-th element a_i is randomly generated; it is a parameter defining the range of possible values, misclassified as 'geo' due to constraint of allowed entity types."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;R_I&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"r_i is the right boundary of the i-th query's subinterval [l_i, r_i] in the permutation array."&lt;SEP&gt;"r_i is the right boundary of the subinterval in the i-th query, used to define the range of elements to be sorted."&lt;SEP&gt;"r_i is the upper bound of the interval from which the i-th element a_i is randomly generated; it is a parameter defining the range of possible values, misclassified as 'geo' due to constraint of allowed entity types."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;QUERY FUNCTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A recursive function in the student’s code that calculates the count of elements in a range [L,R] that are less than a target value, using difference between two persistent tree states."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Query Function is a subroutine in the student program designed to compute the expected absolute difference between two intervals [L[i], R[i]] and [L[j], R[j]] using inclusion-exclusion on the solve() function."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
    </node>
