      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Winning Line refers to any straight line of three identical symbols ('X' or 'O') in a row, column, or diagonal on the 3x3 grid, which results in victory for the player who completed it."&lt;SEP&gt;"A winning line refers to any straight line of three identical symbols ('X' or 'O') in a row, column, or diagonal on the 3x3 grid, which determines the winner of the tic-tac-toe game."&lt;SEP&gt;"A winning line refers to any straight line of three identical symbols ('X' or 'O') in a row, column, or diagonal on the 3x3 grid, which results in victory for the player who completes it."</data>
