    <node id="&quot;井字棋&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"井字棋是一个3x3网格的回合制策略游戏，玩家轮流落子，目标是率先将三个棋子连成一线（行、列或对角线），当前处于残局状态，尚未分出胜负。"&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋是一种3x3格子的回合制策略游戏，玩家通过在行、列或对角线上连成三个相同棋子获胜，当前为残局状态，双方落子数相等，尚未分出胜负。"&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋是小L与炸鸡正在进行的两人零和博弈，目标是率先将三个棋子连成一线（行、列或对角线），当前为残局状态，双方落子数相等且未分胜负。"&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋是一种3x3格子的回合制策略游戏，玩家通过将三个棋子连成一线（行、列或对角线）来获胜，当前为残局状态，双方落子数相等且未分胜负。"&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋是一种3x3棋盘的回合制策略游戏，玩家通过将三个棋子连成一线（行、列或对角线）来获胜。当前为残局状态，双方落子数相等，尚未分出胜负，且轮到小L行动。"&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋是一种3x3棋盘的策略游戏，玩家轮流落子，目标是先让自己的棋子在行、列或对角线上连成一线以获胜。当前为残局状态，双方落子数相等，尚未分出胜负。"&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋是一种3x3棋盘的回合制策略游戏，玩家通过将三个棋子连成一线（行、列或对角线）来获胜。当前为残局状态，双方落子数相等，尚未分出胜负，轮到小L行动。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fbf67613a3aed791c8801433f136cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;S_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"s_{i,j} is the state variable representing the content of cell (i,j) on the tic-tac-toe board, with possible values 'X', 'O', or 'G'. It encodes the current configuration of the game."&lt;SEP&gt;"s_{i,j} is the state variable representing the content of cell (i,j), which can be 'X', 'O', or 'G'."&lt;SEP&gt;"s_{i,j} is the state variable representing the content of the cell at position (i,j) on the tic-tac-toe board, taking values 'X', 'O', or 'G'."&lt;SEP&gt;"s_{i,j} is the state variable representing the content of the cell at position (i,j) on the tic-tac-toe board, with possible values 'X', 'O', or 'G'."&lt;SEP&gt;"s_{i,j}表示棋盘上第i行第j列单元格的状态，是描述当前棋局的核心变量，取值为'X'、'O'或'G'，用于定义游戏状态和胜负条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"s_{i,j} is the state variable representing the content of the cell at position (i,j) on the tic-tac-toe board, which can be 'X', 'O', or 'G'."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THREE-IN-A-ROW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Three-in-a-row is the winning condition in tic-tac-toe, achieved when a player places three of their marks consecutively in a row, column, or diagonal."&lt;SEP&gt;"Three-in-a-row is the winning condition in tic-tac-toe, requiring three identical symbols ('X' or 'O') aligned in a row, column, or diagonal."&lt;SEP&gt;"Three-in-a-row is the winning condition in tic-tac-toe, requiring a player to align three of their marks in a row, column, or diagonal. It defines the objective of the game and determines victory."</data>
