    <node id="&quot;小鸡&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"小鸡是出题者，设计了《小鸡的排列构造》题目，但无法编写正确复杂度的checker，因此寻求他人帮助。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是本题的出题者，设计了《小鸡的排列构造》题目，但无法编写正确复杂度的checker，因此寻求帮助。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是本题的出题者，设计了《小鸡的排列构造》题目，但无法编写正确复杂度的checker，因此寻求帮助。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是题目《小鸡的排列构造》的出题者，因无法编写正确复杂度的checker而寻求帮助，是本题背景中的核心人物。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是本题的出题者，设计了《小鸡的排列构造》题目，但无法编写复杂度正确的checker，因此寻求帮助。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是这道编程题目的出题者，遇到了编写正确复杂度checker的困难，因此寻求帮助。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;《小鸡的排列构造》&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"《小鸡的排列构造》是一个算法题目，涉及对排列子区间排序后元素位置变化的查询，是本题的背景题目。"&lt;SEP&gt;"《小鸡的排列构造》是一个算法题目，涉及对排列子区间的排序与元素位置追踪，是本题的背景题目。"&lt;SEP&gt;"《小鸡的排列构造》是一个算法题目，涉及对排列子区间的排序与位置查询，是本题的背景题目。"&lt;SEP&gt;"《小鸡的排列构造》是一个编程竞赛题目，涉及对排列子区间排序后元素位置变化的查询，是本题的背景题目。"&lt;SEP&gt;"《小鸡的排列构造》是一个算法题目，涉及对排列的子区间排序并查询元素位置变化，是本题的背景题目。"&lt;SEP&gt;"《小鸡的排列构造》是一个编程竞赛题目，涉及对排列子区间排序后元素位置变化的查询，是本题的背景题目。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECORD ID: 108-1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Record ID: 108-1 is a specific submission record timestamped 2025-02-11 14:07:51, capturing the evaluation instance of the student's program with its partial correctness score."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A data structure used in the student's code to efficiently answer range queries about the number of elements less than a given value in subarrays, implemented via node copying and recursion in the modify and query functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Persistent Segment Tree is a data structure used in the student program to efficiently answer range queries about element ranks in permutations, enabling logarithmic-time queries across different versions of the array."&lt;SEP&gt;"Persistent Segment Tree is the data structure used in the Student Program to efficiently answer range queries about element ranks, enabling logarithmic-time queries over sorted subintervals of the permutation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;L_I, R_I, C_I&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"l_i, r_i, c_i are parameters of each query: defining a subinterval [l_i, r_i] and the original position c_i whose element's new position after sorting is to be determined."&lt;SEP&gt;"l_i, r_i, c_i are variables representing the query parameters: left bound, right bound, and target position in the subarray [l_i, r_i] for which the sorted position of the original c_i-th element must be determined."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;108-1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"108-1 appears to be a designation or identifier for an organization, possibly a unit, project, or operational code, given its format and association with a timestamp."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eb58fd6ca0592bab1397eeb0fc1e161d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2025-02-11 14:07:51&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The timestamp 2025-02-11 14:07:51 represents a specific moment in time when the entity '108-1' was recorded or activated, indicating a discrete event in a log or operational sequence."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eb58fd6ca0592bab1397eeb0fc1e161d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHECKER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Checker 是用于验证算法输出正确性的程序模块，本题中小鸡无法编写复杂度正确的 checker，因此需要外部帮助来实现其功能。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The checker is the automated system or program used to validate the correctness of student submissions for the problem. It is implied to be under development or flawed, as the problem setter (小鸡) cannot write a correct one."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;排列&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"排列是指由 1 到 n 的整数构成的无重复序列，是本题中所有查询操作的基础数据结构，涉及子区间排序与位置映射。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;子区间 [L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"子区间 [l_i, r_i] 是排列中的一个连续片段，每次查询对其实行升序排序，并追踪原位置 c_i 处元素的最终位置，是核心操作单元。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;位置 C_I&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"位置 c_i 是子区间 [l_i, r_i] 中的一个特定索引，查询要求确定排序后原位于该位置的元素的新位置，是每次询问的关键输出目标。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;M 次询问&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"m 次询问是指对同一排列进行的 m 个独立查询，每个查询独立处理子区间排序与元素位置追踪，不改变原数组。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECORD ID: 108-2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Record ID: 108-2 是学生程序提交的系统记录，包含提交时间（2025-02-11 14:07:51）和评分结果（18.75分），用于追踪程序表现。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECORD ID: 109-1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Record ID: 109-1 appears to be an internal identifier for a data record, likely associated with a system or platform used for tracking scores or evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Record ID: 109-1 is a specific submission record timestamped 2025-02-11 14:08:16, documenting the evaluation instance of the Student Program with a score of 18.75%."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a4e754cf4e65b38587d0bdb951cadc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;A[K]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"a[k] is the value at position k in the original permutation, used in the query logic to determine how many elements are smaller than it within the range [l_i, r_i]."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROOT[I]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"root[i] is the root node of the persistent segment tree after processing the first i elements of the permutation, used to compute range rank queries efficiently."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CNT[]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"cnt[] is an array storing the count of elements in each segment tree node, used to compute the number of elements in a given value range."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LS[], RS[]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"ls[] and rs[] are arrays storing left and right child pointers of segment tree nodes, forming the structure of the persistent segment tree."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2025-02-11 14:08:16&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The timestamp 2025-02-11 14:08:16 marks a specific moment when a score of 18.75 was recorded, indicating an event of data capture or assessment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9a4e754cf4e65b38587d0bdb951cadc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;18.75&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The score obtained by the student’s program on the test cases, indicating partial correctness due to a logical error in the output formula or query logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The score of 18.75 represents a quantified result from a system evaluation, possibly a test, assessment, or performance metric, occurring at the recorded timestamp."&lt;SEP&gt;"The score of 18.75 represents a quantitative outcome from an evaluation, test, or system assessment, likely tied to the recorded timestamp and record ID."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9a4e754cf4e65b38587d0bdb951cadc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5e647b8d8fdb67f040f7de12aa44b67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;C_I&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"c_i is the original position in the subinterval [l_i, r_i] whose element's new position after sorting is to be determined."&lt;SEP&gt;"c_i is the target position in the original array for the i-th query, for which the new position after sorting the subinterval [l_i, r_i] must be determined."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PERMUTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A permutation is an array of n distinct integers from 1 to n, arranged in any order, which is the core data structure manipulated in the problem."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUBINTERVAL SORTING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Subinterval Sorting is the core operation in each query, where elements in the range [l_i, r_i] are sorted in ascending order to determine the new position of the element originally at c_i."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subinterval sorting is the operation performed in each query, where elements within [l_i, r_i] are sorted in ascending order, and the movement of the element originally at c_i is tracked."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MODIFY FUNCTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A recursive function in the student’s code that builds a persistent segment tree by creating new nodes when updating the tree with a new value at position p."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROOT ARRAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An array of root nodes for persistent segment trees, where root[i] represents the state of the segment tree after processing the first i elements of the permutation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CNT ARRAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An array storing the count of elements in each segment tree node, used to answer range frequency queries efficiently."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LS AND RS ARRAYS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Arrays representing left and right child pointers for each node in the persistent segment tree, enabling tree traversal during modify and query operations."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;A ARRAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An array storing the input permutation of integers, indexed from 1 to n, used as the base for building the persistent segment tree."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2025-02-11 14:08:37&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The timestamp 2025-02-11 14:08:37 marks a specific recorded instance of an automated scoring event, likely part of a larger evaluation or testing system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The timestamp of the evaluation record for the student’s submission, indicating when the partial correctness result was recorded."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a5e647b8d8fdb67f040f7de12aa44b67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECORD ID: 110-1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A unique identifier for the specific test submission and evaluation result, used for tracking and debugging the student’s code in a contest system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Record ID: 110-1 appears to be an internal identifier for a system or database record, possibly associated with an organizational logging or scoring system."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a5e647b8d8fdb67f040f7de12aa44b67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;P&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"p is the permutation array of length n, composed of integers from 1 to n, used as the input for all queries."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POSITION MAPPING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Position Mapping refers to the task of tracking where the element originally at position c_i moves after the subinterval [l_i, r_i] is sorted."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;好数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红定义了'好数组'的概念，是该概念的提出者和规则制定者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了好数组的概念，是该事件的原创者和规则设定者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是“好数组”概念的提出者，定义了其两个核心判断条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8af7cfb62173340e7ef202c51be3c0d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb93b3d8dd3d7a52c8db5aa7be12e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-934cc7b3a877cbd7ad4ae67d1ccb33c0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;长度为K的连续子数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">36.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红定义了‘好数组’的标准，而‘长度为k的连续子数组’是需要应用该标准进行判断的具体对象。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了判断长度为k的连续子数组是否为'好数组'的标准，是该事件的提出者和规则制定者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出了判断长度为k的连续子数组是否为“好数组”的问题，是该事件的定义者和问题提出者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出了判断长度为k的连续子数组是否为“好数组”的问题，因此直接定义了该事件的判定标准。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7ca5047ad2314016a91534ae51d7d7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79d7d963b8a058798cc18c9a690fc98e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff1c9451165769991bdb3906da8d57d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4df85ce295d523e4b50f09ff04d5c7bc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;回文数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">38.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红定义了‘回文数组’作为‘好数组’判断的基础条件之一，是其逻辑体系的核心组成部分。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了回文数组作为“好数组”判断的基础条件，是该概念的源头。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红明确定义了回文数组的概念，作为判断'好数组'的基础标准。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了“回文数组”的概念作为“好数组”的必要条件之一，是其问题逻辑的基础。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7ca5047ad2314016a91534ae51d7d7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79d7d963b8a058798cc18c9a690fc98e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff1c9451165769991bdb3906da8d57d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4df85ce295d523e4b50f09ff04d5c7bc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">47.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红定义了‘好数组’的条件，其判断依赖于对数组结构的分析，数组是问题的核心数据载体。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了基于数组结构的“好数组”概念，数组是其问题的核心数据结构。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红对数组执行操作（乘以2），目的是最小化其极差，二者存在直接的控制与优化关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红对数组执行乘2操作，目的是最小化其极差，二者是操作者与操作对象的直接关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红持有该数组，并希望通过操作修改它以达成目标，是问题的发起者和操作主体。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ff1c9451165769991bdb3906da8d57d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca5047ad2314016a91534ae51d7d7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-802a483142e00c23622efad16d2e5519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;回文&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红将回文作为“好数组”定义的基准条件，是该概念的理论基础。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ff1c9451165769991bdb3906da8d57d8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;修改恰好一个元素&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红在定义“好数组”时明确要求通过修改恰好一个元素使数组变为回文，这是问题的核心约束条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红将'修改恰好一个元素'作为'好数组'的必要条件，是该事件的核心规则制定者。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ff1c9451165769991bdb3906da8d57d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4df85ce295d523e4b50f09ff04d5c7bc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;中国&quot;">
      <data key="d3">382.0</data>
      <data key="d4">“中国”与“小红”共同构成一个高度本土化、自洽且不可分割的叙事单元，深度嵌入中国编程教育体系，特别是中国信息学奥林匹克竞赛（NOI）及国际信息学奥林匹克竞赛（IOI）的文化与实践框架中。小红并非泛化的虚构角色，而是中文算法竞赛语境中一个具有明确地域性、语言性与制度性特征的符号性人物，其命名、语言风格、行为模式与问题设定均严格遵循中文环境与中国教育规范。她的姓名“小红”作为典型中文名，强化了其文化识别度与本土化象征，成为中文算法题中代表中国青少年学生身份的标志性符号。

小红的活动背景和语言环境始终明确指向中国，所有相关题干、学生程序及解题逻辑均以中文呈现，无任何外文化痕迹，体现出鲜明的本土化属性。在不同题目中，她可能作为学生或解题者出现，反映中国青少年在编程竞赛中的典型参与身份；在其他情境下，她亦可作为隐含的出题者或问题背景的构建者，体现中国竞赛出题者常用的叙事范式。这种角色切换并非身份矛盾，而是其作为“中国编程教育体系典型代表”的功能性延伸，旨在构建贴近本土教学实践、易于中国学生理解与共鸣的问题场景。

“中国”作为小红所处的唯一且明确的文化、语言与教育语境，不仅为其存在提供背景，更决定了整个叙事系统的规范与导向。所有相关题目在表达方式、教学目标与解题逻辑上均严格遵循中国编程教育的体系标准，使小红与“中国”共同成为中文算法题中不可或缺的文化与教育隐喻。二者共同构成一个标准化、高度本土化的叙事系统，代表了中国信息学竞赛特有的文化身份与教育实践。小红的存在与功能完全依附于中国本土的教育制度与文化语境，无任何脱离这一框架的解释空间，其意义与价值仅在“中国”这一特定语境中得以完整实现。因此，小红作为中国学生或出题者的身份，本质上是“中国”教育文化在编程竞赛中的具象化表达，二者密不可分，共同塑造了中文算法题独特的叙事传统与教学语境。题目以中文撰写，使用中文命名（如“小红”），符合中国数学</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-29764514e79d905f57239a2bf826b46d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e545f02779dfb717361dfc31cb72c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-079897d4e6ab7c8bef85d55cc1a46ac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58fc77dbcd0a97d49a184217f891dcb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7907aaf6e77e8266bb40e1c8a136bf60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c02916b7b0e5a87f92d544844a99ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-985dca88cf19334aa6bccf195ded5fbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad0b2a1773fb3f15dee0ac6d32877cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7738af741f87817ecb754f66dfca01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47baadad1b80a9eb7ea15b9cd824968b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d4818f978c53c37b43ca5128a7e29f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06373e967b229fd23b64bfbbc0860861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad8afc7ac300d86b72e962805041fa5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe6cf8d6835af29afa5ade64370e360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d300103154c5f70514a4d86cc50a94df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb726f40228a938cab23f8ee251f3349&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2a57305752e3a687103dd58dbee53bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ac191ac64f16e456c655d4b8863811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56cf64b248d90f79e1afa9d0cd84c04a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d2aa75d8324c591292a5206cbd69bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70a2665d10418a7ca4b53ae850057cff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa783b90d0126e6fe65518c125bef47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-504efc1d29aab22b90705499f57173fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef1f71a373fc41a4b61f69de3413bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-264071873a8220efc52cdb3c6f973f1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7230c75a37c25448800f6f28d89050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-934cc7b3a877cbd7ad4ae67d1ccb33c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66aa472cb9a249d5511f69ff4cdc9520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c34d00a1cb1d7916cefb78fbc43896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0be1ff21d6f00384f294e712dc03c7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d855de4fc3c8066acae7529422e672d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbee70be3b8011ff77829977d78f0058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e091fd25a6ba2509fa168c85c52636ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb70ce68f01832942dce770ad4d1320&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d7c8c700f1653b2de9c2e270fef6e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8639879bd177c95139010b9025b24c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d45a376c5f8e29b656fb8024a9e1fab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-412f096b4887f07bc254759a350f79a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8796025571904280b91872c5eb3f6610&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73f9ea9d2375a46897793031515ffea7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44c8edff064a63bf1c338d7c234b2385</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">60.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 defines the matrix size n, which must be even for a 好矩阵 to exist, making n a critical parameter in her problem definition."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem requires input n as the total array length, which defines the input space for the好数组 computation."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红要求构造长度为 n 的排列，因此 n 是她问题定义中的核心参数，直接决定问题规模和约束数量。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出的问题依赖于参数 n 来定义排列长度，n 是她需求中的核心输入变量。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了n作为矩阵维度的参数，并设定其必须为偶数，n是好矩阵定义的核心变量，由小红直接引入。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红在问题中引入n作为矩阵维度参数，定义了好矩阵的结构依赖于n的偶数值，n是小红设定的核心变量。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红需知道 n 的值以理解问题规模，从而正确计算所需操作次数和总成本。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红需知道n的值以理解问题规模，从而判断操作的可行性与最优性。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c4c926060a3af4a149ab3816fc63a59e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbee70be3b8011ff77829977d78f0058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-934cc7b3a877cbd7ad4ae67d1ccb33c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c34d00a1cb1d7916cefb78fbc43896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453</data>
