      <data key="d4">"A subarray is classified as 好数组 if and only if cnt equals exactly 1, making cnt the decisive metric."&lt;SEP&gt;"cnt变量用于计算子数组中不匹配的对称元素对数量，当cnt==1时判定为好数组，是核心判断逻辑。"</data>
