    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">163.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program 使用中文注释与题面，符合中国编程竞赛（如NOI、ACM）的典型语境，表明其开发者或使用者位于中国。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program uses Chinese-language problem context and follows standard Chinese competitive programming conventions (e.g., #define int long long, use of std::cin), indicating its origin and adaptation within the Chinese programming competition ecosystem."&lt;SEP&gt;The Student Program is a C++-based programming artifact developed within China’s competitive programming and educational ecosystem, reflecting the distinct stylistic, linguistic, and cultural norms of Chinese algorithmic competitions. It is written in C++ using conventions ubiquitous in China’s programming contest environment, including the use of #include&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;, #define int long long, std::ios::sync_with_stdio(false), 1-indexed arrays, and std::pair — all hallmark practices observed on Chinese online judge (OJ) platforms such as Luogu, Codeforces China, and those used in the National Olympiad in Informatics (NOI) and ACM-ICPC competitions. The program’s problem statements are presented in Chinese, and its source code includes Chinese-language variable comments and culturally specific coding patterns, confirming its origin in a Chinese academic context. These features collectively indicate that The Student Program was likely created by a Chinese student as part of formal or extracurricular training for national or regional programming contests, and was probably submitted to a Chinese-language OJ platform. The integration of Chinese linguistic elements with standardized Chinese competitive programming syntax underscores its deep embedding within China’s educational infrastructure for algorithmic problem-solving, making it a clear indicator of its Chinese developmental and institutional origin.</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e545f02779dfb717361dfc31cb72c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7738af741f87817ecb754f66dfca01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06373e967b229fd23b64bfbbc0860861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad8afc7ac300d86b72e962805041fa5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe6cf8d6835af29afa5ade64370e360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb726f40228a938cab23f8ee251f3349&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2a57305752e3a687103dd58dbee53bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-504efc1d29aab22b90705499f57173fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7230c75a37c25448800f6f28d89050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c34d00a1cb1d7916cefb78fbc43896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e091fd25a6ba2509fa168c85c52636ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb70ce68f01832942dce770ad4d1320&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d7c8c700f1653b2de9c2e270fef6e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ac191ac64f16e456c655d4b8863811</data>
