    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">57.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n defines the size of the matrix required for the '好矩阵' event, as the conditions (even dimensions, quadrant division) are all functions of n."&lt;SEP&gt;"n is the size parameter of the matrix, determining the dimensions and quadrant sizes of the '好矩阵' — it must be even for the problem to be well-defined."&lt;SEP&gt;"n是好矩阵的维度参数，决定了矩阵大小、区域划分方式及操作复杂度，是定义好矩阵的数学基础。"&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 is defined only for matrices of size n×n where n is even, so n is a necessary condition for the existence of a good matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;"n决定了矩阵的规模和分区方式，是定义好矩阵结构（如左上区域大小为n/2×n/2）的唯一参数。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n是‘好矩阵’定义的维度参数，决定了矩阵大小、区域划分和操作复杂度，是整个问题的基础输入。"</data>
