    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;牛可乐&quot;">
      <data key="d3">64.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"牛可乐 defined the problem in which n is a key input parameter determining the string length constraint for cuteness evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在题目中给定整数 n 作为字符串长度的输入参数，是问题设定的核心变量之一。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在题目中定义了 n 作为字符串长度的输入参数，是其问题设定的核心变量之一。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在题目中定义了参数n作为字符串长度的输入，是可爱度问题的核心变量之一。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 defines n as an input parameter that specifies the required length of the string t in the problem statement."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 defines the problem in which n is a key input parameter for string length, directly influencing the solution space."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 defines the problem in which n is a required input parameter for the length of string t, establishing the constraint space."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在题目中定义了 n 作为字符串长度的输入参数，是问题约束的核心组成部分。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7b7c2c9549b0f15b3ed9c255cd57c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d58149e2705f5337a0bc1e192ab33a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">107.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The entities "M" and "N" are interdependent input parameters in a problem that requires constructing a string of length N such that its "可爱度" (loveliness score) is exactly M. The relationship between N and M is governed by strict logical and mathematical constraints that determine whether a valid solution exists. Specifically, a solution is only possible when N ≥ M and N − M ≤ 26; if N &lt; M or N − M &gt; 26, no valid string can be constructed, making these conditions essential for problem feasibility. Multiple descriptions confirm that N represents the length of the target string, while M represents the desired可爱度, and their values jointly define the problem instance. Some descriptions incorrectly suggest N &gt; M is required, but the consistent constraint across most sources is N ≥ M, implying equality (N = M) is permissible and corresponds to a trivial solution (e.g., a string of N distinct characters with no repetitions). The upper bound of N − M ≤ 26 arises from constraints on substring or subsequence structure, likely tied to the alphabet size (26 lowercase English letters), limiting how much the可爱度 can deviate from the string length. Although one description erroneously associates N and M with array dimensions and runtime errors due to uninitialized variables, this appears to reference an implementation flaw in a student program rather than the core problem definition, and is thus disregarded as irrelevant to the problem’s logical structure. The constraint is fundamental and must be satisfied for any solution to exist, and while student implementations may partially or incompletely encode this logic, the problem’s correctness hinges on the condition: M ≤ N ≤ M + 26. Together, N and M form a tightly coupled parameter pair that defines the problem space, with no valid solution possible outside these bounds.</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67a35ea6ed4e42eb7c4874b218ee041d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d58149e2705f5337a0bc1e192ab33a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;字符串外串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">50.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n 作为输入参数，是‘字符串外串’事件中构造字符串的必要长度约束，决定问题的可解性。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 是‘字符串外串’问题中的关键输入参数，决定了字符串的长度约束，是问题求解的基础条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 是‘字符串外串’问题中的关键输入参数，决定了字符串长度的约束条件，是问题求解的核心变量之一。"&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串”这一事件的求解依赖于输入参数 n（字符串长度），是问题实例化的必要条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 是‘字符串外串’题目中的关键输入参数，用于限定字符串长度，是问题求解的必要条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 是构造字符串 t 的长度约束，是‘字符串外串’事件的输入参数之一。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 是‘字符串外串’问题的输入参数之一，决定字符串长度，直接影响问题的可解性。"</data>
