    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;A[I][K]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable n defines the loop bounds for row-wise traversal of the array, critical for the correctness of the a[i][k] checks."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;A[K][J]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable n defines the loop bounds for column-wise traversal of the array, critical for the correctness of the a[k][j] checks."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student's code uses 'n' as the matrix dimension, indicating their implementation depends on this variable for loop bounds."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7effc3a8936d5e21e04e38b0253505c0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
