      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n is a fundamental parameter of the problem《小鸡的排列构造》, defining the size of the permutation input and constraining the algorithm’s design."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;PERMUTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n defines the size of the permutation, ensuring the array contains exactly the integers from 1 to n."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;K&quot;" target="&quot;牛可乐&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"牛可乐定义了 k 作为字符串可爱度的最大整数，是整个问题的核心度量标准。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;K&quot;" target="&quot;A&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Variable 'k' is used to iterate over elements of matrix 'a' in nested loops to evaluate conditions on rows and columns."&lt;SEP&gt;"k 是连续子串 a 的长度，a 的存在性决定了 k 是否可达。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e5949ffd4dcb4848ea0732665205b59</data>
