      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"T is the data structure type used to populate the array a[M], which stores all constraints for processing in the student program."&lt;SEP&gt;"T 结构体被用于实例化 a[M] 数组的每个元素，a[M] 是 T 类型的集合。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A[M]&quot;" target="&quot;STD::SORT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The array a[M] is sorted using std::sort to prioritize constraints with smaller l_i, enabling the greedy assignment strategy."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A[M]&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program uses array a[M] to store all input intervals for processing, linking raw input to algorithmic logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 使用 a[M] 存储输入数组，是其算法处理的原始数据来源。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0</data>
