      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans 变量计算将原数组转换为双生数组所需的最小操作次数，是衡量解题正确性的核心输出。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-44c8edff064a63bf1c338d7c234b2385</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program computes and stores the maximum possible damage in the variable ans, which is its final output."&lt;SEP&gt;"ans is the output component of the Student Program, storing the sequence of swaps it generates to achieve the goal, making it an essential part of the program's functionality."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7907aaf6e77e8266bb40e1c8a136bf60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
