    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;PI&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"PI is the data type used to store each swap coordinate pair in the ans vector, forming the structural basis of the output sequence."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7907aaf6e77e8266bb40e1c8a136bf60</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 2/2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 2/2 populates the ans structure with swap operations, which are later outputted to transform the matrix, making ans the central output container of the logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1e118fc6033f61b8968a68a6cbe21cd8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
