      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans contains the sequence of swaps needed to convert the input matrix into a 好矩阵, making it the operational pathway to achieving the target event."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1e118fc6033f61b8968a68a6cbe21cd8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The goal of Dragon's Breath is to maximize the value stored in ans, which represents the highest possible damage output."&lt;SEP&gt;"ans records the maximum number of monsters defeated by any single Dragon's Breath activation, representing the solution to the optimization problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;SUM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans is intended to capture a final result derived from Sum operations, though it is never assigned a value in the given code."&lt;SEP&gt;"ans is updated using the value of Sum for each center coordinate (i,j), making Sum a direct contributor to the final result."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
