    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;STD::COUT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans is the value computed by the program and passed to std::cout for display, making std::cout the output destination for ans."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3e307f6e0f75e0c72f6c263b74efaa1f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;SIGNED MAIN ()&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The main function executes the logic that computes the value of ans, making it the source context for the result."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3e307f6e0f75e0c72f6c263b74efaa1f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;MIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Min is used in a conditional expression to compute the value stored in ans, directly influencing the final output."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4655c44a0c410e0c718d92b308d741b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;CNT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Cnt is a key variable in determining the value of ans, used in both the conditional and default calculation paths."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4655c44a0c410e0c718d92b308d741b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;X&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"x is a multiplier in the calculation of ans, directly scaling the result based on the number of iterations or conditions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4655c44a0c410e0c718d92b308d741b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"y contributes to the ans calculation through a term involving (Cnt - Min) / 2, affecting the final output when conditions are met."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4655c44a0c410e0c718d92b308d741b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L&quot;" target="&quot;R&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l和r共同定义滑动窗口的边界，确保每次检查的子数组长度恒为k，是遍历机制的关键变量对。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8af7cfb62173340e7ef202c51be3c0d4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"cnt 的计算公式 2*m - n 本意是平衡重复字符数量，但逻辑错误导致无法正确构造满足 m 的字符串。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;MIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Min and Cnt are directly compared in the conditional expression to determine which branch of the computation to execute, forming the core logic of the algorithm."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3e307f6e0f75e0c72f6c263b74efaa1f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;X&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Cnt is multiplied by x in the else branch and contributes to the calculation of ans in the conditional branch, making x a key scaling factor."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3e307f6e0f75e0c72f6c263b74efaa1f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"y is applied proportionally to the difference between Cnt and Min, indicating it represents a secondary cost or incremental value in the computation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3e307f6e0f75e0c72f6c263b74efaa1f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student likely miscalculated the usage of Cnt, especially in the bitwise and arithmetic operations, causing divergence from the correct answer."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3e307f6e0f75e0c72f6c263b74efaa1f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;A[I][K]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The counter cnt is incremented when all elements in row i are ≤ 1, based on the state of flag f after row traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c79d0a874a6ba47efd4742ec70c1e196</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;A[K][J]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The counter cnt is incremented when all elements in column j are ≤ 1, based on the state of flag f after column traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c79d0a874a6ba47efd4742ec70c1e196</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;A[I][J]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The matrix a[i][j] is scanned to determine if rows or columns contain only values ≤ 1, incrementing cnt accordingly."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3f02234c0d5217769809ae214a58779b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;F&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The flag f is reset and reused to count rows and columns where all elements are ≤ 1, directly influencing the cnt variable's value."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;FLAG&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"If cnt is incremented for both row and column checks without any f=1, it may lead to flag being set to 1, indicating a correct condition in the student’s flawed logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;A&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The counter 'cnt' is incremented based on conditions evaluated across rows and columns of matrix 'a', directly reflecting properties of the matrix."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9e5949ffd4dcb4848ea0732665205b59</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STD::IOS::SYNC_WITH_STDIO(FALSE)&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"该优化语句提升 solve 函数的输入输出效率，确保在大量测试下运行流畅。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STD::CIN.TIE(NULLPTR)&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"该语句优化 solve 函数的输入读取速度，减少IO延迟，提高整体性能。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STD::COUT.TIE(NULLPTR)&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"该语句优化 solve 函数的输出速度，确保结果能快速输出，符合竞赛编程要求。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
