    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;3阶行列式&quot;">
      <data key="d3">57.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program attempts to solve the 3阶行列式 event by generating a matrix based on input x, though it contains logical errors in element computation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to generate a 3阶行列式 that satisfies the problem constraints, but fails due to incorrect logic in computing element e."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 的目标是生成一个满足条件的3阶行列式，但其算法存在缺陷导致无法正确计算行列式值。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program试图通过代码实现3阶行列式的构造，是解决该事件的尝试方案。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to solve the 3阶行列式 construction problem by generating a matrix based on input x, though it contains logical errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to generate a 3阶行列式 by hardcoding and computing matrix elements based on x, but fails to ensure correctness across all inputs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to solve the 3x3 determinant problem, but the code is unrelated to matrix construction and instead processes string operations, indicating a fundamental misunderstanding of the task."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2e8103be36cfb2447eeee275964beaf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb726f40228a938cab23f8ee251f3349&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb70ce68f01832942dce770ad4d1320&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-122f34a10a694b4546099c481788102d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-468ecda2a7ffd84f7956eab9b179bd56</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;X&quot;">
      <data key="d3">48.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program 接收x作为输入，并试图通过计算调整矩阵元素（如e）使行列式值等于x，是程序的核心输入变量。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program takes x as input and attempts to compute matrix elements such that the determinant equals x, making x the central target of the algorithm."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program takes x as input and computes matrix elements to achieve a determinant equal to x, directly linking the code’s logic to this variable."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program takes x as input and attempts to compute matrix elements such that the determinant equals x, making x central to the logic of the solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is designed to compute a 3x3 determinant whose value equals x, making x the central mathematical target of the program's logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2e8103be36cfb2447eeee275964beaf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb726f40228a938cab23f8ee251f3349&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-122f34a10a694b4546099c481788102d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35ba454db150409dfa2569afe0680c61</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
