      <data key="d4">"The value 1 is hardcoded as multiple elements in the student program's matrix, forming the structural basis of the solution and contributing to its rigidity and failure under edge cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"The value 1 is used multiple times in the Student Program as fixed matrix elements to satisfy the absolute value constraint."</data>
