    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">308.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program contains logical flaws that lead to the Error Description, indicating it fails to correctly solve the transformation problem."&lt;SEP&gt;The Student Program is the direct subject of the Error Description, which serves as the official assessment identifying the program as fundamentally flawed in its implementation and conclusively linking its incorrect output to systemic logical deficiencies. The Error Description explicitly evaluates the Student Program as failing to produce a valid “好矩阵” (good matrix), a required output specification that demands the proper relocation of '1's to the top-left quadrant of the matrix without corrupting its overall state. This failure stems not from superficial bugs but from deep errors in array handling and median calculation, particularly in the program’s transformation logic from input n to output m, and in its computation of val(a). Despite operating within imposed constraints, the program’s internal algorithm consistently produces outputs that deviate from the expected solution, resulting in an official rejection and a partial score of 40.0—confirming that while some operational functionality may be present, the core transformation logic is materially incorrect. The Error Description systematically documents these flaws as the definitive cause of the program’s failure, establishing a direct validation and feedback relationship between the Student Program’s defective code and the erroneous results it generates. All descriptions converge in affirming that the Student Program is the source of the error, and the Error Description functions as the authoritative record of its inadequacy in meeting the problem’s requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is the subject of the Error Description, as it is identified as producing incorrect results."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program received the Error Description as its evaluation result, indicating that its implementation contains logical flaws despite partial correctness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program received an Error Description indicating partial correctness (18.75%), meaning its implementation contains a logical flaw despite using the correct data structure."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e545f02779dfb717361dfc31cb72c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7907aaf6e77e8266bb40e1c8a136bf60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06373e967b229fd23b64bfbbc0860861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe6cf8d6835af29afa5ade64370e360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad8afc7ac300d86b72e962805041fa5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e118fc6033f61b8968a68a6cbe21cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2a57305752e3a687103dd58dbee53bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70a2665d10418a7ca4b53ae850057cff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa783b90d0126e6fe65518c125bef47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef1f71a373fc41a4b61f69de3413bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-264071873a8220efc52cdb3c6f973f1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c34d00a1cb1d7916cefb78fbc43896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a6cf2c1b884640bd458e20b236729e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d7c8c700f1653b2de9c2e270fef6e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8639879bd177c95139010b9025b24c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa52e5b330629e1cee02304480f542</data>
