    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">120.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 is a component of the Student Program, representing the core logic implementation for solving the matrix transformation problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is a core component of the Student Program, containing the main logic for reading input and performing swaps to achieve the desired matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is a part of the Student Program, representing the incomplete or faulty code implementation submitted by the student."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the actual code snippet that constitutes the Student Program, representing its implementation logic and structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the actual code implementation of the Student Program, containing the flawed algorithm for matrix transformation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the actual implementation within the Student Program that contains the flawed algorithm for moving '1's to the top-left quadrant."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is a core component of the Student Program, implementing the swap logic intended to achieve the good matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the actual code implementation of the Student Program, representing its incomplete and flawed execution logic for matrix transformation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the actual code implementation submitted as part of the Student Program, containing the flawed algorithm."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the actual implementation of the Student Program, containing the flawed algorithm for moving '1's to the top-left quadrant."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the actual implementation within the Student Program that contains the flawed logic for moving elements to form the '好矩阵'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the actual implementation within the Student Program that contains the flawed logic for moving '1's, making it the core component responsible for the error."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the core component of the Student Program, containing the flawed logic that leads to the failure."</data>
