    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;A_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">22.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program processes array elements including a_i, using cnt[] to count frequencies and a[] to store values."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program processes array elements including a_i, using cnt[a[i]] and sorting to compute valid pairs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program processes elements a_i from the input array to count valid pairs, but contains a logical flaw in its divisor iteration."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
