      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program implicitly considers a_j through nested iteration over divisors, but fails to correctly identify valid j pairs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program processes array elements including a_j, attempting to find pairs (a_i, a_j) satisfying the condition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44</data>
