    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 2/2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">69.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 2/2 is a component of the Student Program, showing the specific part of the code responsible for outputting swap operations that is deemed incorrect."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a critical component of the Student Program, containing the core algorithmic logic that is flawed and causes the partial score."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a critical part of the Student Program, containing the flawed logic that causes the program to score only 40.0; the segment is a subcomponent of the overall student submission."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a critical part of the Student Program, containing the core flawed logic for computing minimum operations to achieve a 双生数组."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program包含Program Segment 2/2作为其输出部分，该片段存在逻辑缺陷导致答案错误。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a critical part of the Student Program that implements the core algorithm for generating swap operations, and its logic directly contributes to the observed error."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2是Student Program的核心输出部分，负责生成交换指令，其错误直接导致整体程序失败。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a critical part of the Student Program, responsible for outputting swap operations; its structure suggests the logic for generating valid moves may be incomplete or buggy."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2ef1f71a373fc41a4b61f69de3413bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-264071873a8220efc52cdb3c6f973f1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7230c75a37c25448800f6f28d89050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e091fd25a6ba2509fa168c85c52636ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d7c8c700f1653b2de9c2e270fef6e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70a2665d10418a7ca4b53ae850057cff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ac191ac64f16e456c655d4b8863811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e118fc6033f61b8968a68a6cbe21cd8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
