      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program achieved a score of 40.0 due to logical errors in its implementation of the 双生数组 transformation, directly linking the program’s quality to its evaluation score."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program received a score of 40.0 due to its incorrect handling of median values and element frequency balancing in the 双生数组 transformation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e091fd25a6ba2509fa168c85c52636ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7230c75a37c25448800f6f28d89050f</data>
