    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">103.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program的目标是生成将输入矩阵转化为好矩阵的操作序列，但因逻辑错误未能正确实现该目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program试图通过算法将输入矩阵转换为‘好矩阵’，但其逻辑错误导致无法正确达成该目标，因此与该事件存在目标关联但失败。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is designed to transform any input matrix into a '好矩阵' by performing adjacent swaps, making it a procedural implementation targeting the '好矩阵' event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to transform the input matrix into a good matrix using adjacent swaps, but fails due to incorrect logic in tracking and moving '1's to the top-left quadrant."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is explicitly designed to transform any given 01 matrix into a '好矩阵' by swapping adjacent elements, directly targeting the event's defined conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is an attempted computational solution to achieve the '好矩阵' configuration, but its logic for moving '1's is flawed and does not guarantee correct placement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program aims to transform the input matrix into a 好矩阵, but contains logical errors that prevent correct transformation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to achieve the transformation into a '好矩阵' but fails due to incorrect logic in moving '1's to the top-left quadrant."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to transform an input matrix into a '好矩阵' by swapping adjacent elements, but contains logical errors in its coordinate tracking and movement logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program aims to transform an arbitrary 01 matrix into a '好矩阵' using adjacent swaps, but fails due to flawed logic in moving '1's to the correct quadrant."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is intended to produce a sequence of swaps that transforms the input matrix into a 好矩阵, but its output is incorrect."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is an algorithmic attempt to transform an arbitrary 01 matrix into a '好矩阵' by moving '1's to the top-left quadrant using adjacent swaps, directly targeting the event’s defined conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is an attempted computational implementation to transform an arbitrary 01 matrix into a '好矩阵', but fails due to incorrect logic in positioning '1's."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2ef1f71a373fc41a4b61f69de3413bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e545f02779dfb717361dfc31cb72c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7907aaf6e77e8266bb40e1c8a136bf60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8639879bd177c95139010b9025b24c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa783b90d0126e6fe65518c125bef47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06373e967b229fd23b64bfbbc0860861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe6cf8d6835af29afa5ade64370e360</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
