    <edge source="&quot;3阶行列式&quot;" target="&quot;X&quot;">
      <data key="d3">50.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 3阶行列式 event is defined by the constraint that its determinant must equal x, making x an essential parameter of the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"x is the target determinant value that the 3x3 matrix must satisfy, making it a critical constraint in the construction event."&lt;SEP&gt;"x 是3阶行列式必须等于的目标值，是构造该行列式的唯一约束条件之一。"&lt;SEP&gt;"x 是3阶行列式必须等于的目标值，整个构造问题围绕使行列式结果等于x展开。"&lt;SEP&gt;"x is the target value that the 3x3 determinant must equal, making it a critical constraint in the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fb726f40228a938cab23f8ee251f3349&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7738af741f87817ecb754f66dfca01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-468ecda2a7ffd84f7956eab9b179bd56</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
