      <data key="d5">chunk-dbb70ce68f01832942dce770ad4d1320</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;X&quot;" target="&quot;3阶行列式构造&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"x is the target output value that the 3阶行列式构造 event must achieve, defining the goal condition of the mathematical problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;X&quot;" target="&quot;E&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"e is directly calculated based on x in the student program, making it the primary variable linking the input x to the output determinant value."&lt;SEP&gt;"e is the only variable element in the student's matrix designed to adjust the determinant value to match the input x, making it directly dependent on x."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0c9c6802989382170739955a5bae46c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
