      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a is the symbolic representation of the continuous substring used in the cuteness definition, derived from the input string t."&lt;SEP&gt;"a 是连续子串在定义中的符号表示，直接代表该结构。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d58149e2705f5337a0bc1e192ab33a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95</data>
