    <edge source="&quot;数值膨胀之美&quot;" target="&quot;乘以2操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"数值膨胀之美是本题的主题，其核心即为乘以2操作带来的数值扩张效应，用于优化极差。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;数值膨胀之美&quot;" target="&quot;区间乘2操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"区间乘2操作是‘数值膨胀之美’这一题目核心机制的体现，通过数值膨胀实现极差优化。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-29266653556f4758c4fbea2541c63207</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;极差&quot;" target="&quot;A[N] - A[1] * 2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a[n] - a[1] * 2 是学生程序中错误计算的极差候选值，试图表示最大值与翻倍后最小值的差，但未考虑翻倍区间可能位于中间。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;极差&quot;" target="&quot;(A[N] - A[1]) * 2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(a[n] - a[1]) * 2 是学生程序中错误的极差估计，错误地假设整个数组被翻倍，而题目仅允许翻倍一个子区间。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;极差&quot;" target="&quot;区间乘2操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"区间乘2操作直接影响数组中元素的数值分布，从而改变最大值和最小值，最终决定极差的大小。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-29266653556f4758c4fbea2541c63207</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;极差&quot;" target="&quot;乘以2操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"乘以2操作是唯一允许的改变数组元素的手段，其目的是直接减小极差，是问题求解的核心动作。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-802a483142e00c23622efad16d2e5519</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;极差&quot;" target="&quot;A[1] * 2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a[1] * 2 是学生程序中用于计算新最小值的候选值，直接影响极差的计算结果，是错误逻辑的关键节点。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-802a483142e00c23622efad16d2e5519</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;极差&quot;" target="&quot;A[I] * 2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a[i] * 2 是学生程序中用于更新最大值的候选值，其与a[i+1]的组合决定极差的当前值，是算法核心变量。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-802a483142e00c23622efad16d2e5519</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;极差&quot;" target="&quot;A[I + 1]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a[i + 1] 作为未翻倍元素，被错误地用作最小值候选，导致在翻倍区间后低估最小值，是程序错误的根源。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-802a483142e00c23622efad16d2e5519</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;乘以2操作&quot;" target="&quot;非空区间&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"乘以2操作必须作用于一个非空区间，二者是操作对象与操作行为的直接绑定关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"乘以2操作必须作用于一个非空区间，该区间是操作的唯一合法作用域，是解题的关键约束。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-802a483142e00c23622efad16d2e5519</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">86.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 中的随机输入、错误的 cnt 计算和不完整验证机制是造成 Error Description 中问题的直接原因。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Error Description directly evaluates the Program Segment 1/2 as incorrect, identifying it as the source of the failure to produce a valid '好矩阵'."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Error Description directly evaluates the flaws in Program Segment 1/2, explaining why it only scores 40.0 out of 100."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Program Segment 1/2 is the source of the errors documented in the Error Description, which identifies logical flaws in median calculation and array swapping."&lt;SEP&gt;"The logical flaws in Program Segment 1/2 directly cause the Error Description, which identifies the solution as incorrect despite meeting operational constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"The errors in Program Segment 1/2 directly cause the Error Description, which identifies the program’s incorrect behavior and deviation from expected output."&lt;SEP&gt;"The errors in Program Segment 1/2 directly cause the failure documented in the Error Description, particularly in the coordinate update logic (cnti, cntj) and swap sequencing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The errors in Program Segment 1/2, such as incorrect cnti/cntj tracking and improper swap sequencing, are directly cited in the Error Description as reasons for failure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The logic in Program Segment 1/2 directly causes the errors described in the Error Description, such as incorrect placement of '1's and invalid swap sequences."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d45a376c5f8e29b656fb8024a9e1fab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8796025571904280b91872c5eb3f6610&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-504efc1d29aab22b90705499f57173fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 37-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 is the submitted code associated with Record ID: 37-1, which logs its evaluation timestamp and result in an automated system."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d45a376c5f8e29b656fb8024a9e1fab6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;左上区域&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The code attempts to move all '1's to the left-top quadrant (1 ≤ i,j ≤ n/2) by incrementing cnti and cntj, but incorrectly assumes a greedy row-column filling order that disrupts the matrix state."&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序试图通过交换操作将所有'1'移动至左上区域，但其控制变量cnti和cntj的更新逻辑错误，导致无法正确定位目标区域。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8639879bd177c95139010b9025b24c97</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 contains the algorithmic attempt to construct a '好矩阵' by repositioning '1's to the top-left quadrant, but the swap logic incorrectly increments cntj and cnti, leading to misplacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the implementation attempt to achieve the '好矩阵' condition, but its algorithm incorrectly handles coordinate tracking and swap sequencing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 contains the flawed algorithm meant to achieve the '好矩阵' structure, but its coordinate manipulation logic (cnti, cntj) does not correctly map '1's to the top-left quadrant."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;N 行 N 列矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The n 行 n 列矩阵 is the input data processed by Program Segment 1/2, which attempts to manipulate its elements via swaps to meet the good matrix condition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;右上区域&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"学生程序未能正确清除右上区域的'1'，因交换逻辑未覆盖所有需要重置的单元格，导致区域不符合'好矩阵'要求。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;左下区域&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"学生程序的交换机制未确保左下区域全为'0'，因移动'1'时未考虑其原始位置是否属于左下区域。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;右下区域&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"右下区域中的'1'未被正确移除，程序未设计全局清理机制，导致该区域残留非零值。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;交换两个相邻字符&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 uses adjacent swaps (via std::swap and coordinate pairs) as the only allowed operation to reposition '1's toward the top-left quadrant."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2aa783b90d0126e6fe65518c125bef47</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;58-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
