    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">83.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student is the source of the error described, as their answer was identified as incorrect and documented in the error record."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student submitted an incorrect answer that triggered the error record, indicating a mismatch between their solution and the expected correct output."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student’s submitted solution is the direct subject of the Error Description, which points out its flaws and deviations from the expected answer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student provided an incorrect answer, which triggered the error description documenting the discrepancy."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student submitted an incorrect solution that is documented in the error description, indicating a misunderstanding of matrix logic or boundary conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student is the source of the error described, as their incorrect answer triggered the error record."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student submitted the code that triggered the error description, making them the source of the identified mistake."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student submitted an incorrect answer that triggered the error description, indicating a mismatch between their code logic and the expected solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student submitted an incorrect answer that triggered the Error Description record, directly linking the individual to the documented event."</data>
