    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;SUM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The redeclaration of Sum inside the loop shadows the outer variable, leading to incorrect accumulation and logical errors that manifest as runtime failures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The runtime error is directly linked to the improper usage and scoping of the Sum variable, which is redeclared inside loops and may not persist as intended."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The runtime error is exacerbated by the inconsistent indexing of sum2 array (using [0][i] and [1][i]) without guaranteed array bounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The use of sum2[0][i] and sum2[1][i] assumes a 2-row array, but no allocation is shown — this causes heap corruption or segmentation fault."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;U&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The runtime error is directly caused by unbounded manipulation of variable 'u', which can go negative or exceed array bounds."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;V&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The runtime error is exacerbated by uncontrolled increments and decrements of 'v', which can exceed 'm' or go below 0."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The undefined value of 'm' causes the loop 'i &lt;= m' to access invalid memory, a primary source of the runtime error."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
