      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"错误描述是Record ID: 40-1所记录的具体内容，该ID是错误描述的唯一容器和引用标识，存在归属关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-47baadad1b80a9eb7ea15b9cd824968b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;排列构造问题&quot;" target="&quot;\{2,3,1,5,4\}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"\{2,3,1,5,4\} is a concrete example of a valid solution to the permutation construction problem, illustrating correct output."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;排列构造问题&quot;" target="&quot;\{1,2,2\}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"\{1,2,2\} is an invalid case that demonstrates violation of the uniqueness constraint in the permutation construction problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;排列构造问题&quot;" target="&quot;\{1,3,4\}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"\{1,3,4\} is an invalid case that demonstrates violation of the range constraint in the permutation construction problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;排列构造问题&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"[l_i, r_i] provides the per-position constraints that make the permutation construction problem non-trivial and algorithmically challenging."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1~N&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I,R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"[l_i,r_i] 的取值必须是 1~n 的子集，否则无法构成合法排列，二者构成包含与约束关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1~N&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"[l_i, r_i]的取值必须是1~n的子集，每个区间约束必须在1~n的全局值域内才有意义，二者构成约束与值域的包含关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1~N&quot;" target="&quot;ANS[]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans[]数组的每个元素必须是1~n中的唯一整数，以满足排列定义，因此它直接承载1~n的值域约束。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I,R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;L = 1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l=1 是用于匹配 [l_i,r_i] 区间内可用数值的游标，算法通过比较 l 与区间边界进行分配。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS[M]&quot;" target="&quot;L = 1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable l is used to assign values to ans[M], with each assigned value incrementing l, ensuring uniqueness in the permutation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS[M]&quot;" target="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans[M] is the output data structure intended to represent the solution to the '井然有序之窗' event, but its current implementation is flawed."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STD::SORT&quot;" target="&quot;L = 1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"After sorting constraints, the algorithm initializes l = 1 to greedily assign the smallest available integer that fits each constraint in order."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L = 1&quot;" target="&quot;STD::SORT(A + 1, A + 1 + N)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"排序后，算法从 l = 1 开始顺序分配，排序是 l 递增分配策略的前提。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L = 1&quot;" target="&quot;L &gt; N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l 从 1 开始递增，若最终 l &gt; n 则表示成功填满所有位置，两者构成状态演化关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1 \SIM N&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The range [l_i, r_i] must be a subset of 1~n for a valid solution to exist, making 1~n the universal superset of all possible values."&lt;SEP&gt;"[l_i, r_i] 的取值必须是 1 \sim n 的子集，否则无法构造合法排列，二者构成数值域的包含与约束关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1 \SIM N&quot;" target="&quot;INT ANS[M]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"int ans[M] 用于存储 1 \sim n 中每个数字的分配结果，是生成合法排列的输出载体。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1 \SIM N&quot;" target="&quot;P&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The permutation p must consist exactly of integers from 1 to n, as defined by the problem constraints."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;" target="&quot;1 ~ N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"1 ~ n 是‘井然有序之窗’事件中定义的排列数值范围，构成问题的核心约束条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The requirement to use integers 1 ~ n exactly once is the defining condition of the '井然有序之窗' event, making it central to the problem’s validity."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"井然有序之窗”事件的核心挑战在于满足每个位置的 [l_i, r_i] 区间约束，是问题定义的本质。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;STRUCT T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"struct T 用于封装 [l_i, r_i] 和索引 id，是程序中对区间约束的结构化表示。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;1 ~ N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Each [l_i, r_i] constraint must overlap with the domain {1, 2, ..., n} for a valid permutation to exist; the problem requires assigning values from this domain."&lt;SEP&gt;"[l_i, r_i] 的取值必须在 1 ~ n 范围内，否则无法构成合法排列，两者构成包含与约束关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"T结构体封装了[l_i, r_i]区间及其原始位置id，是问题约束在程序中的直接数据表示。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"val(a) depends on the random generation of each a_i within the interval [l_i, r_i], making the interval a foundational constraint for the computation of val(a)."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2a6cf2c1b884640bd458e20b236729e4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;#DEFINE INT LONG LONG&quot;" target="&quot;3E5 +7&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"#define int long long 是为了支持 3e5 +7 大小数组中可能的大数值运算，防止整数溢出，二者共同应对大规模输入场景。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;牛可乐&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"牛可乐提出的问题是构造满足可爱度为 m 的字符串 t，t 是问题的输出目标。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"t 的可爱度必须恰好等于 m，m 是 t 必须满足的输出目标。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;数字N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"T表示测试用例数量，每个测试用例包含一对数字n和m，T控制n和m的读取循环次数。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;数字M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"T控制对多个数字m的处理，每个m对应一个独立的转换判断任务。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"T is the node counter used during the construction of the persistent segment tree to allocate new nodes without modifying previous versions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The global variable T is used to assign unique identifiers to each new node created in the persistent segment tree during modifications."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小苯&quot;" target="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;">
      <data key="d3">36.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小苯是'硝基甲苯之袭'这一事件的主体，负责解决该算法问题，因此直接关联该事件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯是'硝基甲苯之袭'这一事件的主体，负责解决该算法问题，因此直接关联该事件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯是‘硝基甲苯之袭’这一事件的直接参与者，负责解决该算法问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯是‘硝基甲苯之袭’这一事件中的核心参与者，负责解决该数学问题。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小苯&quot;" target="&quot;A_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">32.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小苯 is solving a problem that involves elements a_i from the array, making a_i a key variable in his computational task."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯需要处理数组中的每个 a_i 元素，寻找满足条件的配对，是问题中 a_i 的操作主体。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the problem solver who considers pairs of elements including a_i as part of the array to satisfy the condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the problem solver who must consider all possible a_i elements in the array to find valid pairs satisfying the condition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小苯&quot;" target="&quot;A_J&quot;">
      <data key="d3">32.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小苯 is solving a problem that involves elements a_j from the array, making a_j a key variable in his computational task."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯需枚举所有 a_j（j&gt;i）与 a_i 配对，以判断是否满足 a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the problem solver who considers pairs of elements including a_j as part of the array to satisfy the condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 must evaluate every valid a_j (with j &gt; i) to check the condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;OI-WIKI&quot;" target="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"'硝基甲苯之袭'问题中引用了OI-Wiki作为位运算（如异或）知识的权威参考资料，建立知识来源关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"'硝基甲苯之袭'题目中引用了OI-Wiki作为位运算知识的权威参考资料，用于解释xor运算的背景知识。"&lt;SEP&gt;"‘硝基甲苯之袭’问题中引用了 OI-Wiki 作为位运算知识的权威参考资料，以帮助理解异或运算。"&lt;SEP&gt;"‘硝基甲苯之袭’问题中引用了OI-Wiki作为位运算知识的权威参考资料，用于解释xor运算的背景。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;OI-WIKI&quot;" target="&quot;XOR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"OI-Wiki is cited as the reference source for understanding the xor (bitwise XOR) operation used in the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki is referenced as the source of knowledge explaining the xor operation, which is essential to understanding the problem’s condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki 提供了关于 xor（异或）运算的官方解释和数学背景，是理解问题中该运算符的权威来源。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki is referenced as the authoritative source explaining the xor operation used in the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;OI-WIKI&quot;" target="&quot;小L的位运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">12.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"OI-Wiki作为参考资料，为小L的位运算操作提供理论支持和背景知识。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki作为知识来源，为小L的位运算事件提供了理论支持和背景参考。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;OI-WIKI&quot;" target="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d3">5.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"OI-Wiki 提供的位运算知识包含位交换与优化策略的背景，间接支持对 y 成本的优化理解。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;OI-WIKI&quot;" target="&quot;位运算教学事件&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"OI-Wiki作为外部知识来源，为炸鸡教授的位运算内容提供了理论支持和参考资料，增强教学权威性。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki作为知识来源，为位运算教学事件中的异或运算等概念提供官方参考资料，增强教学权威性。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki作为知识来源，为位运算教学事件中的概念（如异或运算）提供理论支持和参考资料。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;OI-WIKI&quot;" target="&quot;按位异或运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"OI-Wiki 提供了按位异或运算的官方解释和数学定义，是该运算的权威知识来源。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki提供按位异或运算的官方定义和数学性质，是该事件的理论依据。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;OI-WIKI&quot;" target="&quot;位运算教学&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"OI-Wiki作为参考资料，支撑了炸鸡所教授的位运算知识内容。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;" target="&quot;A_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"硝基甲苯之袭 事件中的核心对象是数组元素 a_i，其与 a_j 的关系构成问题的求解目标。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;" target="&quot;A_J&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"硝基甲苯之袭 事件要求枚举所有 a_j（j&gt;i）以寻找满足条件的配对，a_j 是问题解空间的关键组成部分。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;" target="&quot;GCD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The condition gcd(a_i, a_j) is central to the problem '硝基甲苯之袭', defining the mathematical constraint to be satisfied."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;" target="&quot;XOR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The xor operation is a core requirement in the problem '硝基甲苯之袭', as it must equal the gcd of the pair."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;" target="&quot;A_1, A_2, ..., A_N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"硝基甲苯之袭 is the problem event that operates on the array {a_1, a_2, ..., a_n} to count valid pairs."&lt;SEP&gt;"硝基甲苯之袭" is the thematic event centered around the array of integers a_1 to a_n and the condition they must satisfy."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_I&quot;" target="&quot;GCD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">36.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j) directly links a_i to the gcd function, which computes a mathematical property of the pair."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_i 与 a_j 通过 gcd 函数计算最大公约数，是问题数学约束的核心组成部分。"&lt;SEP&gt;"gcd is the mathematical function applied to a_i and a_j to compute their greatest common divisor, forming the right-hand side of the constraint."&lt;SEP&gt;"gcd is applied to a_i and a_j to compute their greatest common divisor, which must equal their XOR result."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_I&quot;" target="&quot;XOR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">36.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The value of a_i is used in the xor operation with a_j to satisfy the problem’s condition, making xor a critical operator for a_i."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_i 与 a_j 进行异或运算，是问题中与 gcd 等价的另一核心运算条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"xor is the bitwise operation applied to a_i and a_j to form the left-hand side of the constraint."&lt;SEP&gt;"xor is the bitwise operation applied between a_i and a_j to produce the left-hand side of the equation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_I&quot;" target="&quot;A_J&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a_i and a_j are paired elements in the array that must satisfy the mathematical condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j), forming the core relationship of the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_i and a_j are paired elements in the array where i &lt; j, and their relationship is defined by the constraint a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_I&quot;" target="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze is the originator of the problem in which a_i are random variables whose absolute differences form the basis of the expectation calculation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the person who defined the sequence where each a_i is randomly generated within [L[i], R[i]]."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_I&quot;" target="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Each a_i contributes to val(a) through its absolute difference with adjacent elements a_{i-1} and a_{i+1}, forming the core structure of the sum."&lt;SEP&gt;"val(a) is directly computed from the sequence of a_i values by summing the absolute differences between consecutive elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"val(a) is directly computed from the sequence of a_i values by summing their consecutive absolute differences."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_I&quot;" target="&quot;L[I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"L[i] defines the minimum possible value that a_i can take in the random generation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"L[i] defines the minimum possible value that a_i can take, constraining the random generation of each sequence element."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_I&quot;" target="&quot;R[I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"R[i] defines the maximum possible value that a_i can take in the random generation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"R[i] defines the maximum possible value that a_i can take, constraining the random generation of each sequence element."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_I&quot;" target="&quot;L_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l_i defines the minimum possible value for the randomly generated element a_i, directly constraining its distribution."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_I&quot;" target="&quot;R_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"r_i defines the maximum possible value for the randomly generated element a_i, directly constraining its distribution."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_J&quot;" target="&quot;GCD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j) directly links a_j to the gcd function, which computes a mathematical property of the pair."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_J&quot;" target="&quot;XOR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The value of a_j is used in the xor operation with a_i to satisfy the problem’s condition, making xor a critical operator for a_j."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GCD&quot;" target="&quot;XOR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"gcd and xor are opposing operations in the constraint: one is arithmetic (gcd), the other is bitwise (xor), and their equality defines the problem’s core logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"gcd 和 xor 在问题中被设定为相等关系，构成核心数学条件：a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
