    <edge source="&quot;右下区域&quot;" target="&quot;01矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The right-bottom region of the 01矩阵 must be modified to contain all '0's to meet the 好矩阵 condition, indicating a direct transformation target within the input matrix."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c4c926060a3af4a149ab3816fc63a59e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;右下区域&quot;" target="&quot;N/2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n/2是划分右下区域的行列边界，决定了其位于右下且行列均大于n/2的区域范围。"&lt;SEP&gt;"右下区域的行列边界均从n/2+1开始，n/2是划分该区域的决定性阈值。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1ad0b2a1773fb3f15dee0ac6d32877cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d300103154c5f70514a4d86cc50a94df</data>
