      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The matrix a[i][j] is evaluated to set the flag variable f based on whether any element exceeds 1 in a row or column."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3f02234c0d5217769809ae214a58779b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
