    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;BFS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS algorithm uses 'm' to validate grid boundaries during traversal of columns."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS algorithm uses M as a boundary constraint to validate grid coordinates during traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443</data>
