    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The non-contiguous subsequence must also have length m to match the continuous substring, making m the critical threshold for the problem’s condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"不连续子序列的长度必须等于 m，且必须由至少两段不相邻子串构成，是定义‘可爱度’的必要条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4f71a436c68bda6c051ade04f84d6c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
