      <data key="d3">32.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m defines the number of columns in the Grid Map, constraining the horizontal range of valid coordinates for Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the number of columns in the Grid Map, establishing its horizontal dimension."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the number of columns in the grid map, directly determining its horizontal size and the range of valid j coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the number of columns in the Grid Map, establishing its horizontal size and constraints for Dragon's Breath propagation."</data>
