    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;DX&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The dx array defines horizontal movement directions used by BFS to explore neighboring cells."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;DY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The dy array defines vertical movement directions used by BFS to explore neighboring cells."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;VIS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS uses the VIS array to avoid reprocessing already visited cells, ensuring correct traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The vis array is essential to BFS for marking visited cells and avoiding reprocessing."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;CNT1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"cnt1 is incremented within BFS to count the size of each connected component."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;CNT2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"cnt2 is updated within BFS to count adjacent zero cells surrounding the current component."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;ANS1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS updates ANS1 when it finds a larger connected component of 1s, making it a key output variable."&lt;SEP&gt;"ans1 is updated by BFS to track the largest connected component found."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;MIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS updates MIN to store the minimum adjacent zero count among the largest connected components, enabling optimization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Min is updated by BFS to store the minimum surrounding zero cells among the largest components."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;STD::QUEUE&lt;PI&gt;&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"std::queue&lt;PI&gt; 是 bfs 算法的核心数据结构，用于管理待访问的坐标节点。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;DX[] 和 DY[]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"dx[] 和 dy[] 为 bfs 算法提供方向支持，使其能在网格中向四个方向扩展搜索。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;F&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS uses the F map to track and count unique adjacent zero cells without duplication."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L的解题思路通过bfs函数实现，该函数是其算法逻辑的编程表达，尽管存在错误，但意图是解决数学题的核心方法。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L通过学生程序间接使用BFS算法来解决数字转换问题，BFS是其实现逻辑的核心方法。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;STD::MAP&lt;INT , INT&gt; F&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"bfs函数依赖std::map&lt;int , int&gt; f来记录访问状态，二者构成函数内部的数据结构依赖关系，因f声明错误导致bfs无法运行。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;数字N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS算法以数字n为起始节点，探索所有可能的转换路径，是搜索的初始输入。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;数字M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS算法的目标是检测是否能到达数字m，是搜索的终止条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MIN&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE()&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Min 是 solve() 函数计算并输出的目标变量，代表该函数的核心输出结果，是程序逻辑的终点。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-61548360973c5cefdc1038d32bf69e3c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N × M 矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;边界&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"边界是 n × m 矩阵的外层结构，其存在决定了蓝色极大连通块的掉落判定规则是否需要特殊处理。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;F&quot;" target="&quot;A[K][3 - K + 1]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The expression a[k][3 - k + 1] is evaluated to determine the value of flag f, which checks if any anti-diagonal element exceeds 1."&lt;SEP&gt;"The flag f is set to 1 if any element on the anti-diagonal (a[k][3-k+1]) exceeds 1, establishing a direct conditional dependency."&lt;SEP&gt;"The value of a[k][3 - k + 1] is evaluated to determine the state of flag 'f', making it a direct input to the condition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c79d0a874a6ba47efd4742ec70c1e196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7effc3a8936d5e21e04e38b0253505c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;F&quot;" target="&quot;A[I][K]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The flag f is used to detect if any element in row i exceeds 1, determining whether to increment the counter cnt."&lt;SEP&gt;"The row-wise traversal a[i][k] sets the flag f to 1 if any element in row i exceeds 1, used to determine if the row is valid."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c79d0a874a6ba47efd4742ec70c1e196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;F&quot;" target="&quot;A[K][J]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The column-wise traversal a[k][j] sets the flag f to 1 if any element in column j exceeds 1, used to determine if the column is valid."&lt;SEP&gt;"The flag f is reused to detect if any element in column j exceeds 1, again influencing the counter cnt."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c79d0a874a6ba47efd4742ec70c1e196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;F&quot;" target="&quot;FLAG&quot;">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The global flag variable is set to 1 when all local flag variables 'f' are 0, indicating that no row or column violates the condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"The value of f is used to conditionally set flag to 1 when no elements in a row or column exceed 1, determining the final output."&lt;SEP&gt;"The variable 'f' is used to determine whether 'flag' should be set to 1, creating a direct logical dependency."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3f02234c0d5217769809ae214a58779b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7effc3a8936d5e21e04e38b0253505c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e5949ffd4dcb4848ea0732665205b59</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE()&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"solve() 函数接收并处理矩阵结构，分析其中的蓝色极大连通块与灰色砖块关系，是矩阵数据的逻辑处理主体。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-61548360973c5cefdc1038d32bf69e3c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;字符串外串&quot;" target="&quot;连续子串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"连续子串是‘字符串外串’事件中定义可爱度的两个核心要素之一，构成问题的本质。"&lt;SEP&gt;"连续子串是‘字符串外串’题目中定义的核心概念之一，用于与不连续子序列比较以确定可爱度。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;字符串外串&quot;" target="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">29.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"不连续子序列是‘字符串外串’事件中定义可爱度的另一个核心要素，与连续子串共同构成题目的逻辑基础。"&lt;SEP&gt;"不连续子序列是‘字符串外串’题目的核心创新定义，是区分本题与其他子序列问题的关键。"&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串题目创新性地定义了不连续子序列，作为区别于传统子序列的关键约束，是题目难点所在。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
