    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">65.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"不连续子序列是定义‘可爱度’的另一核心要素，其特殊结构（至少两段不相邻子串）是本题区别于常规子序列问题的关键。"&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度 depends on the existence of a non-contiguous subsequence matching a substring of the same length, making it foundational to the metric."&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度 relies on the existence of a non-contiguous subsequence that matches a contiguous substring, making it a core component of the metric."&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度的值k依赖于是否存在一个与连续子串相等的不连续子序列b，该子序列必须由至少两段不相邻非空子串构成。"&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度的定义依赖于存在一个长度为k的不连续子序列，与连续子串相等，是其必要组成部分。"&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度的定义要求存在一个长度为k的不连续子序列，与连续子串相等，二者共同构成判断依据。"&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度的定义必须满足一个长度为k的不连续子序列与连续子串相等，二者是判定条件的必要对。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67a35ea6ed4e42eb7c4874b218ee041d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;子串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"子串 and 不连续子序列 are the two required components that must be equal in length and content to define可爱度, forming the central logical constraint."&lt;SEP&gt;"子串和不连续子序列是‘可爱度’定义中必须相等的两个结构，共同构成题目判定条件的核心对偶关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ca7b7c2c9549b0f15b3ed9c255cd57c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;字符串 T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"字符串 t must also contain a non-contiguous subsequence (as defined) of length m equal to the substring, which is the critical challenge in constructing t."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串 t must contain a non-contiguous subsequence (as defined) of length m that equals one of its contiguous substrings to achieve可爱度 = m."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
