    <edge source="&quot;SOLVE&quot;" target="&quot;MODULAR ARITHMETIC&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"solve operates within the Modular Arithmetic framework, performing all calculations modulo 10^9 + 7 to prevent overflow and ensure correctness."</data>
