      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze's goal is to maximize the sum of a_{i,j} values hit by Dragon's Breath, making a_{i,j} the key data she acts upon."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze's goal is to maximize the sum of monsters a_{i,j} destroyed by Dragon's Breath, making the monster counts central to her strategy."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
