    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;(X,Y)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">36.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze selects the central coordinate (x,y) to activate Dragon's Breath, making (x,y) the direct target of her action."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze selects the coordinate (x,y) as the origin point to unleash Dragon's Breath, making it the activation point of the ability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze selects the coordinate (x,y) as the center point to activate Dragon's Breath, making it the direct target of her ability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze selects the coordinate (x,y) as the center point to activate Dragon's Breath, making it the origin of the diagonal damage pattern."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze operates on the Grid Map by selecting coordinates to activate Dragon's Breath, making the grid the spatial context of her actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze operates on the grid map, selecting coordinates to maximize the number of monsters defeated using Dragon's Breath."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee</data>
