    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;ABSOLUTE EXPECTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">37.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze is the central figure in the problem named 'Absolute Expectation', which revolves around computing the expectation of val(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the originator or subject of the problem concerning the Absolute Expectation of the sequence's value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the named individual associated with the problem titled 'Absolute Expectation', suggesting they are the creator or subject of the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the named individual who poses or is associated with the problem of computing the absolute expectation of the sequence value."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a6cf2c1b884640bd458e20b236729e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
