      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">58.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath is an ability that acts upon the grid map, affecting monsters located along diagonal paths within the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates on the grid map, affecting cells along diagonal lines based on the chosen coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates on the grid map, affecting cells along diagonal lines centered at a chosen coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates specifically on the Grid Map, affecting cells along diagonal lines according to the grid's coordinate system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates specifically on the Grid Map, affecting cells along diagonal lines based on the targeted coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that is applied directly onto the Grid Map, damaging monsters along diagonal paths across its cells, with the total damage dependent on the grid's monster distribution."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;(X,Y)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath is always centered at coordinate (x,y), which determines the entire diagonal pattern of destruction."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;(X-1,Y-1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">57.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath extends flame in the direction of (x-1,y-1) as part of its 'X'-shaped damage pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame extends along the (x-1,y-1) direction, destroying monsters on that diagonal line."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates flame in the direction of (x-1,y-1), destroying monsters along that diagonal line."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates along the direction (x-1,y-1) as part of its diagonal 'X' pattern, destroying monsters along this line."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates along the direction (x-1,y-1) to destroy monsters on that diagonal line."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath extends its flame along the (x-1,y-1) diagonal direction, damaging all monsters along that line until the grid boundary."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;(X-1,Y+1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">57.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath extends flame in the direction of (x-1,y+1) as part of its 'X'-shaped damage pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame extends along the (x-1,y+1) direction, destroying monsters on that diagonal line."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates flame in the direction of (x-1,y+1), destroying monsters along that diagonal line."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates along the direction (x-1,y+1) as part of its diagonal 'X' pattern, destroying monsters along this line."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates along the direction (x-1,y+1) to destroy monsters on that diagonal line."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath extends its flame along the (x-1,y+1) diagonal direction, damaging all monsters along that line until the grid boundary."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;(X+1,Y-1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">57.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath extends flame in the direction of (x+1,y-1) as part of its 'X'-shaped damage pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame extends along the (x+1,y-1) direction, destroying monsters on that diagonal line."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates flame in the direction of (x+1,y-1), destroying monsters along that diagonal line."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates along the direction (x+1,y-1) as part of its diagonal 'X' pattern, destroying monsters along this line."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates along the direction (x+1,y-1) to destroy monsters on that diagonal line."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath extends its flame along the (x+1,y-1) diagonal direction, damaging all monsters along that line until the grid boundary."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
