      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[0][i] is a precomputed value used to efficiently calculate the total monsters destroyed along a third diagonal of Dragon's Breath."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[1][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[1][i] is a precomputed value used to efficiently calculate the total monsters destroyed along a fourth diagonal of Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"sum2[1][i] stores additional diagonal sums used in the algorithm to efficiently compute maximum Dragon's Breath coverage."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;X-SHAPED FLAME PATTERN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The X-shaped flame pattern is the defining visual and functional characteristic of the Dragon's Breath event, determining which cells are affected."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath damages monsters by summing the values of a_{i,j} along its diagonal paths, making a_{i,j} the fundamental input for its effectiveness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath destroys monsters at each cell (i,j) whose count is stored in a_{i,j}, making it the core data source for damage calculation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath destroys monsters by summing the values of a_{i,j} along all diagonal paths it covers."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;TMP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"tmp computes the total monsters defeated in one activation of Dragon's Breath by summing contributions from four diagonal directions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;" target="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Grid Map is defined by the monster counts a_{i,j} at each cell (i,j), which determine the total damage output of Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map's content is defined by the values a_{i,j}, which specify the number of monsters at each cell."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} defines the monster density at each cell (i,j) of the Grid Map, forming the data basis for calculating Dragon's Breath effectiveness."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} defines the monster density at each cell (i,j) of the grid map, forming the core data input for the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;" target="&quot;SUM[0]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum[0] is derived from the grid map's diagonal structure (j - i constant) to enable efficient computation of monster counts along anti-diagonals."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;" target="&quot;SUM[1]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum[1] is derived from the grid map's diagonal structure (j + i constant) to enable efficient computation of monster counts along main diagonals."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[0]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[0] handles edge cases of the grid map where diagonal propagation goes out of bounds in the negative direction, ensuring correct calculation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[1]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[1] handles edge cases of the grid map where diagonal propagation goes out of bounds in the positive direction, ensuring correct calculation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;" target="&quot;B[M][M]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"b[M][M] is a temporary transposed version of the Grid Map used to standardize computation when the grid is taller than it is wide."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;" target="&quot;SUM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Sum accumulates values of a_{i,j} along diagonal paths to compute the total damage of Dragon's Breath."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;" target="&quot;SUM[0][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum[0][i] is derived by summing a_{i,j} values along specific diagonals to optimize Dragon's Breath calculations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;" target="&quot;SUM[1][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum[1][i] is derived by summing a_{i,j} values along specific diagonals to optimize Dragon's Breath calculations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[0][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[0][i] is derived by summing a_{i,j} values along specific diagonals to optimize Dragon's Breath calculations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[1][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[1][i] is derived by summing a_{i,j} values along specific diagonals to optimize Dragon's Breath calculations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM&quot;" target="&quot;A[U][V]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Sum is the operation that accumulates values from the 2D array a[u][v] along diagonal paths."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[1][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[1][i] stores the result of the Sum operation along the diagonal starting from row n and column i."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[0][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[0][i] stores the result of the Sum operation along the diagonal starting from row 1 and column i."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;I&quot;" target="&quot;A[I][K]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The row index i is used to scan all elements a[i][k] in row i to check if any exceed 1, influencing the flag f."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3f02234c0d5217769809ae214a58779b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ABSOLUTE EXPECTATION&quot;" target="&quot;QUERY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The query function is essential to the Absolute Expectation problem's solution, computing expected absolute differences between adjacent elements using range inclusion-exclusion."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L[I]&quot;" target="&quot;R[I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"L[i] and R[i] define the independent uniform random range for each sequence element a_i, jointly determining the probability distribution of absolute differences."&lt;SEP&gt;"L[i] and R[i] together define the uniform probability interval [L[i], R[i]] from which a_i is sampled."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;" target="&quot;QUERY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"query is used in the main loop to compute the expected contribution of each consecutive pair (a_{i-1}, a_i) to the total val(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"query is used to compute the expected absolute difference between each pair of consecutive a_i and a_{i-1}, which are summed to form val(a)."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;" target="&quot;PROBLEM: TOKITSUKAZE AND ABSOLUTE EXPECTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"val(a) is the core mathematical expression whose expectation is the central goal of the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;" target="&quot;MODULAR ARITHMETIC&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The expectation of val(a) is computed under Modular Arithmetic to produce a result in finite field space, as required by the problem constraints."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;" target="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE AND ABSOLUTE EXPECTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"val(a) is the mathematical expression whose expectation defines the event 'Tokitsukaze and Absolute Expectation'."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;QUERY&quot;" target="&quot;POW&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Pow is used within the query function to compute modular inverses of the total number of possible value combinations for normalization."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;QUERY&quot;" target="&quot;MODULAR ARITHMETIC&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"query relies on Modular Arithmetic to maintain numerical stability and correctness when combining results from multiple solve calls."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;QUERY&quot;" target="&quot;ROOT[I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"root[i] is used as a state in the persistent segment tree to answer range queries between root[l-1] and root[r] to count elements smaller than a[k]."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L_I&quot;" target="&quot;SUBINTERVAL SORTING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l_i specifies the left bound of the subinterval to be sorted in each query, directly influencing the sorting range."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;R_I&quot;" target="&quot;SUBINTERVAL SORTING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"r_i specifies the right bound of the subinterval to be sorted in each query, directly influencing the sorting range."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;QUERY FUNCTION&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE FUNCTION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Query Function relies on the Solve Function to compute partial expectations over interval boundaries, forming a hierarchical dependency."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;QUERY FUNCTION&quot;" target="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The query function is the core operation that retrieves rank information from the persistent segment tree by comparing two versions of the tree."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">311.0</data>
      <data key="d4">小L与炸鸡之间构建了一种多层次、动态互动的复合关系体系，深度融合了教育指导、竞技对抗与人文关怀，展现出技术传授与人性关怀的有机统一。在学术与技能培养层面，炸鸡是小L的核心导师，系统性地教授其平方运算、开方运算、位运算（包括二进制操作与异或运算 a⊕b=c）等数学与计算知识，并直接指导小L解决与之相关的最小花费算法问题，为其在计算机科学与数学领域的基础能力发展提供了决定性支持。与此同时，在非学术领域，小L与炸鸡是井字棋（tic-tac-toe）对弈中的直接对手，双方均以最优策略进行博弈，构成明确的竞争性对抗关系。出于对小L新手身份与经验不足的体谅，炸鸡主动授予其一项特殊特权——允许小L在每局对弈中先行两步，以此平衡竞技公平性。这一特权并非削弱对弈的策略深度，反而凸显了炸鸡在竞争中兼具指导者与对手的双重角色：既坚持竞技的严谨性与策略性，又体现包容、同理心与人文关怀。尽管拥有这一先行优势，小L仍需面对炸鸡以最优策略进行的精准应对，表明该特权的设计旨在促进学习与能力成长，而非确保胜利；炸鸡始终具备充分的能力与策略来应对小L的先行步骤，确保博弈的挑战性与教育价值。综上所述，炸鸡不仅是小L在数学与算法学习中的权威导师，也是其在博弈活动中富有策略性与同理心的对手，二者的关系超越了简单的师生或对手模式，形成了一种融合教育、竞争与情感支持的复合互动模型，深刻体现了技术传授与人性关怀的有机统一。</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fbf67613a3aed791c8801433f136cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa52e5b330629e1cee02304480f542</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;平方&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡教授了平方这一数学运算，是该操作的来源和教学者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡教授了平方这一数学运算，是该运算的来源和教学者。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;开方&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡教授了开方这一数学运算，是该操作的来源和教学者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡教授了开方这一数学运算，是该运算的来源和教学者。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;小L的位运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡教授了位运算的基础知识，为小L的位运算事件提供了理论基础和教学背景。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;小L的数学题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡教授的平方与开方运算直接构成了‘小L的数学题’的解题基础，是该事件的理论来源。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;">
      <data key="d3">80.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the Tic-Tac-Toe Game who designed the special rule granting 小L a double move, believing it to be harmless."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the Tic-Tac-Toe Game, having set the terms of the game including the special privilege for 小L."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who believes their superior skill will negate 小L's double-move advantage."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who, despite their overconfidence, has conceded a strategic advantage to 小L, influencing the game's dynamics."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who designed the special rule (double move) to challenge 小L, believing it to be a harmless concession."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game, relying on strategic play to counter 小L's privilege."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game, employing strategic play and having granted a privilege to 小L, indicating confidence in their own superiority."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game, who has set the condition of a double move for小L, indicating overconfidence in their own strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who, despite their overconfidence, has introduced a rule modification (double move) that affects the game's strategic balance."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who, despite their overconfidence, has introduced a rule modification (double move for 小L) that may alter the strategic balance."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who has introduced a strategic imbalance by granting 小L a two-move privilege."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;O&quot;">
      <data key="d3">166.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡 uses the 'O' symbol to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe board, establishing direct ownership and gameplay identity."&lt;SEP&gt;炸鸡 uses the symbol 'O' to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe board, establishing a direct and consistent association between the player and their game piece. This symbol serves as a clear representation of炸鸡’s actions, ownership, and identity within the game, distinguishing their plays from those of their opponent. Every instance of 'O' placed on the tic-tac-toe grid directly reflects炸鸡’s turn and strategic contribution, reinforcing 'O' not merely as a marker but as an extension of their presence and decision-making in the game. Multiple descriptions confirm this usage without contradiction, collectively affirming that 'O' is the exclusive and symbolic identifier for炸鸡’s moves in tic-tac-toe.</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fbf67613a3aed791c8801433f136cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;井字棋&quot;">
      <data key="d3">56.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡作为井字棋的另一名玩家，其策略和反应决定了小L特权是否能转化为胜势，是游戏胜负的关键变量。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡作为井字棋的对手，其策略和特权的应对方式决定了小L是否能必胜，是游戏规则与策略博弈的关键一方。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋事件的另一位参与者，以聪明策略应对小L的特权，意图阻止其获胜。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋对局的另一位参与者，其策略和特权的让与构成了对局的特殊规则背景。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋的另一名玩家，其策略和特权的设定决定了游戏的平衡性与胜负可能性。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋对局的另一方玩家，其策略和智慧将决定小L的特权是否能转化为胜势。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋对局的另一位参与者，其策略设定为最优，与小L形成对抗关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fbf67613a3aed791c8801433f136cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;棋盘&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡在棋盘上落子（标记为'O'），其策略基于阻止小L获胜并利用规则优势，是直接操作主体。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡的落子同样改变棋盘状态s_{i,j}，其策略依赖于对棋盘当前布局的分析以阻止小L获胜。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;井字棋对局&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡是井字棋对局的另一方参与者，以最优策略应对小L的双步特权，试图阻止其必胜。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;3X3棋盘&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡的每一步落子都改变3x3棋盘的状态，其最优策略旨在封锁小L的潜在连线路径，阻止其利用双步特权获胜。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
