    <edge source="&quot;小L&quot;" target="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;">
      <data key="d3">90.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L is a participant in the Tic-Tac-Toe Game and is attempting to win under special rules that allow a double move."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a primary participant in the Tic-Tac-Toe Game, currently about to make a move with a special two-move advantage."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a primary participant in the tic-tac-toe game, actively trying to exploit the double-move privilege to achieve a winning position."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is an active participant in the tic-tac-toe game, currently about to make a move with a special two-move privilege that could determine the outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a primary participant in the tic-tac-toe game, currently about to make a move under a special privilege that could determine the game's outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a primary participant in the tic-tac-toe game, attempting to win using a special two-move advantage."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a primary participant in the tic-tac-toe game, currently about to make a move with a special two-move privilege that could determine the outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is an active participant in the tic-tac-toe game, currently about to make a move with a special double-move privilege."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a primary participant in the tic-tac-toe game, currently taking their turn with a unique double-move privilege that could influence the outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is an active participant in the tic-tac-toe game, currently about to make a move with a unique double-move privilege that could influence the game's outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a participant in the tic-tac-toe game and is currently on move, with a special advantage that may determine the outcome."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab</data>
