    <edge source="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;" target="&quot;G&quot;">
      <data key="d3">52.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"G denotes empty positions on the board, which are critical for determining possible future moves and strategies in the tic-tac-toe game."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'G' state represents empty cells on the grid, which define the available moves and game progression in the tic-tac-toe game."&lt;SEP&gt;"The symbol 'G' represents empty spaces on the board that are critical for determining possible future moves in the tic-tac-toe game."&lt;SEP&gt;"G denotes empty positions on the board, which are critical to the strategic dynamics of the tic-tac-toe game as potential moves for either player."&lt;SEP&gt;"G denotes empty positions on the board, which are critical to the strategic dynamics of the Tic-Tac-Toe Game as potential future moves."&lt;SEP&gt;"G denotes unoccupied positions on the board, which are critical for determining possible future moves and strategies in the tic-tac-toe game."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'G' state defines the dynamic state space of the game, indicating which positions are still available for play."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab</data>
