      <data key="d4">"The 3x3 Grid is the physical and structural foundation of the Tic-Tac-Toe Game, defining the playable space and rules for alignment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The tic-tac-toe game is played entirely on the 3x3 grid, which defines the spatial and structural rules of the contest."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a</data>
