      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 3x3 board is the physical and logical space where the Tic-Tac-Toe Game is played, defining all possible moves and winning conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The tic-tac-toe game is played on the 3x3 board, which defines the spatial structure and possible moves for both players."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 board is the physical and logical space where the tic-tac-toe game is played, defining all possible moves and winning conditions."</data>
