    <edge source="&quot;ROW&quot;" target="&quot;井字棋游戏&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Rows are fundamental winning structures in the tic-tac-toe game, one of three possible ways to achieve victory."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;COLUMN&quot;" target="&quot;井字棋游戏&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Columns are fundamental winning structures in the tic-tac-toe game, one of three possible ways to achieve victory."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;三个连成一线&quot;" target="&quot;连续走两步&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"连续走两步的特权使小L有机会在一次行动中直接完成或逼近三个连成一线，从而突破炸鸡的防守。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;104-1&quot;" target="&quot;EDUCATIONAL ASSESSMENT SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The educational assessment system generated and manages the unique record ID 104-1 to track this specific student submission and its associated error."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0ae1fc917022eddc74e2fec3c8d34bb4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;2025-02-08 16:27:58&quot;" target="&quot;EDUCATIONAL ASSESSMENT SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The educational assessment system logged the timestamp when the error was recorded, linking temporal data to the submission event."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0ae1fc917022eddc74e2fec3c8d34bb4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小鸡&quot;" target="&quot;《小鸡的排列构造》&quot;">
      <data key="d3">54.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡是《小鸡的排列构造》这道题的出题者，因无法编写正确checker而寻求帮助，直接关联该事件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是《小鸡的排列构造》题目的出题者，因无法编写checker而寻求他人帮助，二者为创造与依赖关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是《小鸡的排列构造》题目的出题者，因无法编写checker而寻求帮助，二者为创作与依赖关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是《小鸡的排列构造》题目的出题者，因无法编写checker而寻求帮助，二者存在直接创作与依赖关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是《小鸡的排列构造》题目的出题者，因该题的checker编写困难而寻求帮助，二者存在直接的创作与依赖关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是《小鸡的排列构造》题目的出题者，因无法编写checker而寻求帮助，二者存在直接创作与依赖关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小鸡&quot;" target="&quot;CHECKER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡 is the creator of the problem and is responsible for the checker, but lacks the ability to implement a correct one, creating a dependency on external help."&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡因无法编写正确的 checker 而寻求帮助，checker 是其题目实现中缺失的关键组件，二者存在明确的功能依赖关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小鸡&quot;" target="&quot;排列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡设计的题目以排列为数据基础，所有查询均围绕排列的子区间展开，排列是其题目构造的核心对象。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小鸡&quot;" target="&quot;M 次询问&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡设计的题目包含 m 次询问的规范，这些询问是题目要求学生程序必须处理的核心输入形式。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小鸡&quot;" target="&quot;SUBINTERVAL SORTING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡’s checker must correctly implement subinterval sorting logic to validate student solutions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小鸡&quot;" target="&quot;POSITION MAPPING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡’s checker must accurately compute position mapping after sorting, which is the core requirement of the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;《小鸡的排列构造》&quot;" target="&quot;L_I, R_I, C_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l_i, r_i, c_i are the core query parameters defined by《小鸡的排列构造》, specifying the exact problem to be solved in each of the m queries."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;《小鸡的排列构造》&quot;" target="&quot;A ARRAY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The a array stores the input permutation that is the central data structure of the problem《小鸡的排列构造》, used as input for the checker."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;" target="&quot;CNT[]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"cnt[] is a core component of the persistent segment tree, storing the count of elements in each node to enable rank queries."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;" target="&quot;LS[], RS[]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ls[] and rs[] provide the tree structure for the persistent segment tree by storing left and right child pointers."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;" target="&quot;MODIFY FUNCTION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The modify function is the core operation that builds and updates the persistent segment tree by creating new versions of nodes during insertion."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;" target="&quot;ROOT ARRAY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The root array stores the root nodes of each version of the persistent segment tree, enabling efficient range queries between any two positions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;" target="&quot;CNT ARRAY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The cnt array stores the count of elements in each node of the persistent segment tree, enabling efficient range frequency queries."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;" target="&quot;LS AND RS ARRAYS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The ls and rs arrays store left and right child pointers for each node in the persistent segment tree, forming the tree structure."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L_I, R_I, C_I&quot;" target="&quot;A[K]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l_i, r_i, c_i define the query scope, and a[k] is the value at position c_i used to compute how many smaller elements lie in [l_i, r_i]."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;108-1&quot;" target="&quot;2025-02-11 14:07:51&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The organization '108-1' is directly associated with the timestamp event, suggesting it was active, triggered, or logged at that precise moment."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-eb58fd6ca0592bab1397eeb0fc1e161d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;排列&quot;" target="&quot;子区间 [L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"子区间 [l_i, r_i] 是排列的连续子序列，每次查询操作均作用于排列的特定子区间，二者是整体与部分的结构关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;排列&quot;" target="&quot;M 次询问&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m 次询问是对同一排列进行的多次独立查询，排列是所有查询操作共享的输入数据源。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;子区间 [L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;位置 C_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"位置 c_i 是子区间 [l_i, r_i] 中的一个指定索引，查询目标是追踪该位置元素排序后的新位置，二者构成操作输入与输出的关联。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RECORD ID: 109-1&quot;" target="&quot;2025-02-11 14:08:16&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Record ID: 109-1 is linked to the timestamp, indicating that the score was captured at this specific moment in the system."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f9a4e754cf4e65b38587d0bdb951cadc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RECORD ID: 109-1&quot;" target="&quot;18.75&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Record ID: 109-1 is associated with the score of 18.75, suggesting it is the unique identifier for this particular assessment result."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f9a4e754cf4e65b38587d0bdb951cadc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;2025-02-11 14:08:16&quot;" target="&quot;18.75&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The timestamp corresponds directly to the recording of the score 18.75, establishing a clear temporal relationship between the event and its measured outcome."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f9a4e754cf4e65b38587d0bdb951cadc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;18.75&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 110-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Record ID: 110-1 corresponds to the score of 18.75, indicating that this identifier is tied directly to the result of a specific evaluation event."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a5e647b8d8fdb67f040f7de12aa44b67</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;18.75&quot;" target="&quot;2025-02-11 14:08:37&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The timestamp 2025-02-11 14:08:37 precisely dates the occurrence of the scoring event that produced the result 18.75."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a5e647b8d8fdb67f040f7de12aa44b67</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;C_I&quot;" target="&quot;SUBINTERVAL SORTING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"c_i is the target position whose post-sort location must be computed after the subinterval [l_i, r_i] is sorted."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUBINTERVAL SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;P&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The permutation p is the array on which subinterval sorting is performed in each query."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;2025-02-11 14:08:37&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 110-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Record ID: 110-1 is linked to the timestamp as it uniquely identifies the log entry containing the scoring event at that specific time."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a5e647b8d8fdb67f040f7de12aa44b67</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;P&quot;" target="&quot;POSITION MAPPING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The permutation p is the source of elements whose positions are tracked after sorting."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
</graphml>
